<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">IMBOMBO- SUKWA BIBLE TRANSLATION PROJECT 19/04/2022</book>
  <para style="h">IMBOMBO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbombo sya batumiwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Imbombo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Imbo</para>
  <para style="mt1">IMBOMBO</para>
  <para style="mt2">SYA BATUMIWA</para>
  <para style="imt">UKWANDA</para>
  <para style="ip">I buku lya Mbombo sya batumiwa kapango aka bwandilo aka Muchipanga sona namo kakasatilila ukufuma mu Yelusalemu ukuya ku Yudeya, ku Samaliya sona na kumbaka ya chisu chosi, ngati mo u Yesu akababusikisya abamanyili bake bo akali atabukite kumwanya (Imbombo 1.8). Likasimbiwa nu Luka yo akasimba sona Amasyu Amisa ukuyana nu Luka. U Luka akaba we dokotala sona akaghesya ngani pa kusimba akisa. Akafumusya amasyu ghake amisa sona ni buku lya Mbombo kwa Tiyofilasi yo akaba mu Giliki, loli amabuku ghakaba sona gha Bakilisitu aba mukaya poka naba Giliki sona naba Yuda (1.1). Imbombo sya Batumiwa sikasimbiwa ngani ngani pakati pa 60-64 AD chifukwa I buku likamala bo u Pabuli akali atafumite mu Jela. U Luka akenda sona nu Mutumiwa u Pabuli sona ngani ngani akasimbila ibuku lya mbombo sya batumiwa mukaya akakulu aka mu Andiyoki. Imbombo sya batumiwa sikubukilisya amasyu amisa agha Luka sona nukwanda nu Yesu bo akubuka kumwanya. U Luka ifundo ya kusimbila yiyanite bubu na masyu ghake amisa ghala. Akamulondagha u Tiyofilasi, sona nukongelela kwa bwingi bwa bakilisitu mu fyo bakamanyila sona akasimba akisa nisya bumi bwa Yesu, namo I Chikilisitu chikasatula. Ibuku lya mbombo sya batumiwa likatupa ichimanyisyo cha bakwanda aba Chipanga sona nukuboneka ngati ukwikala mubumi bwa Yesu. Ichimanyisyo cha batumiwa chikutulangisya utwe mo tubaghile ukusubila amaka gha Mbepo Mwikemo ukusatisya amasyu amisa ku bangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ifya mukati</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ukwanda u Mbepo Mwikemo akisa pa bamanyili sona ni Chipanga chikanda pakukula 1.1—8.1.</para>
  <para style="io2">2. Ichinine I Chipanga chikafwimiwa sona chikakanda pakusata ukukila mu Yelusalemu 8.2—12.23.</para>
  <para style="io3">3. Pakufuma apo u Pabuli akabuka ubulendo bwake ubwa kwanda pa mbombo yake 12.24—14.28</para>
  <para style="io4">4. Po akabukutila kakakumana mu Yelusalemu ukuti binong’one fyo fikulondiwa ku bitiki abapya 15.1-35 Ichinine u Pabuli akabuka ku mbombo yake iya bubili mu bulendo bwake 15.36—18.22 6. Pakufuma apo akabuka kumbombo yake iya butatu mubulendo bwake 18.23—20.38 7. Po u Pabuli akakoliwa mu Yelusalemu 21-26 Pabumalilo akatumiwa ku Lomu 21-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk1.1-4</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mughindikiwa Tiyofilasi, mwibuku lyangu ilya bwandilo ngakusimbila nisya findu fyosi fyo u Yesu akabombagha nukumanyisya, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mupaka pisiku lyo akasenyiwagha ukubuka kumwanya, bo abalaghila mwa Mbepo Mwikemo abatumiwa bo akabasala. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Bo ukutamiwa kwake kwamala, u Yesu akababonekela mumasiku fote mutubalilo utwingi, pakusimikisya ukuti naloli mumi. Abene bakamutesya, po akayugha nabo nisya Bunyafyale bwa Chala. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk24.49</ref>.</char></note>Bo abungana nabo poka, akabalamula akati, “Mutakafumemo mu Yelusalemu, loli mulindililaghe ipangano lya Tata, lyo akati, mukalifwa kwa une, <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Miko1.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Yoh1.33</ref>.</char></note> pakuti u Yohani akabosya na misi, loli mumasiku amapala mukwisa pakosiwa nu Mbepo Mwikemo.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Yesu akusenyiwa pakubuka kumwanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Bo abatumiwa babungana poka nu Yesu, bakamulalusya bakati, “Malafyale, imba pakabalilo aka utanganyokesya sona Ubunyafyale kwa Izilayeli?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Po akababusya akati, “Tesinyu umwe pakumanya ichinja nakabalilo ko u Tata apimite mumaka ghake mwene. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat28.19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Miko16.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk24.47-48</ref>.</char></note>Loli mukwisa pakupokela amaka, bo u Mbepo Mwikemo isa papinyu, po mukwisa pakuba bakamboni bangu mu Yelusalemu, na mu Yudeya mosi, na mu Samaliya, mupaka kubumalilo bwa chisu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Miko16.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luk24.50-51</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo ayugha sisisi, akasenyiwa pakubuka kumwanya bo bakumutesya, sona akafifiwa ni bingu.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Bakaba bakali bakutesya kumwanya bo akubuka, po umwakukenusya bubu abanalume babili bo bakafwala amalaya amaswepu bakimilila pambali pabo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />nukubalalusya ukuti, “Mwe bandu ba mu Galileya, choni cho mwimilile papapo mukutesya kumwanya? U Yesu yo asenyiwa kukwinyu ukubuka kumwanya akwisa pakunyokela bububu, ukuyana namo mukamutesekesya akubuka kumwanya.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwa kupyana pa Yudasi asaliwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matayi27.3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Po abatumiwa bakanyokela ku Yelusalemu ukufuma kwighamba ilya misyunguti, lyo likaba papipi na kaya ka Yelusalemu, lyo bakendaghako pisiku lya kutusya. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat10.2-4</ref>.</char></note>Bo bingila, bakakwela kuchipinda icha pamwanya ko bakikalaghako. Mula mula mukaba u Pitala nu Yohani, u Yakobo nu Andileya, u Filipu nu Tomasi, u Batulomeyo nu Matayi, u Yakobo umwana wa Alifeyo, nu Simoni u Ziloti, nu Yudasi umwana Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bosi baba bakabunganagha pipi pipi pakwiputa, poka na bakolo nu Maliya ung’ina wa Yesu, na bawamwabo.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu masiku ghala, u Pitala akimilila pakati pabanine, (muchilundilo cha bandu bo bakaba ngati wanu handiledi twende bosi poka), nukuyugha ukuti, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Mwe bakamu bangu, amasimbo ghakwanilisiwe gho u Mbepo Mwikemo akayugha ukwendela mwa Davedi nisya Yudasi, yo akalongosya abandu bo bakamukola u Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Pakuti akabelengiwa poka nutwe, pakupokela ichigaba cha mbombo yake.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Akaghula umughunda ni ndalama syo akapokela chifukwa cha mbibi syo akabomba, po akawila umutu, ulufukwe lwake lukapunda, sona amala ghake ghakafumila kusi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Po sisisi sikamanyikwa nabosi bo bakikalagha mu Yelusalemu, po munjugha yabo bakawita umughunda ghulaghula ukuti Akeledama ko kuti, “Umughunda wa Libanda.”)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Pakuti sisimbiwe mwibuku lya Masalimo ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Yileke inyumba yake yibe chisami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">nayumo umundu atakikalaghemo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">sona nimbombo yake yumo apyanilepo.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Pololi chikulondiwa pakusala yumo mubanalume bo bakabanga nutwe akabalilo kosi ko u Malafyale u Yesu akendagha nutwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-4">Miko1.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:6">Mat3.6</ref>.</char></note>ukwandila palosyo lwa Yohani mupaka pisiku lyo akasenyiwagha pakubuka kumwanya ukutuleka utwe. Pakuti weka uwa bababa abe we kamboni nisya kusyuka kubufwe ubwa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Po bakasala abanalume babili, u Jozefu yo bakamwitisyagha ukuti Balasabasi (yo sona bakati Yusito) nu Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Po bakiputa ukuti, We Malafyale, we ukumanya imyoyo ya bandu bosi, po utulangisye weka pa babili aba yo umusalite, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ukuti apyanile pambombo iyi, iya butumiwa bo u Yudasi akabuleka, nukubuka kubuyo bo bukumwenelela. <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Po bakapanga ubulaghusi, po ubulaghusi bukamuwila u Matiyasi, yo akongelesiwa ku batumiwa leveni bala.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukwisa kwa Mbepo Mwikemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Bo isiku lya Pendekositi lyafika, abitiki bosi bakaba poka pabuyo boka. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Umwakukenusya bubu ichongo chikifwika ngati yo mbepo iyamaka iyakukuka ukufuma kumwanya nukwisula munyumba yosi mo bakikalagha. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Po bakatesya fimo fyo fikaboneka ku kwabo ngati syo ndimi sya mulilo, syo sikanyambana nukwikala pa wesi yo akaba mula mula. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Po bosi bakisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo, nukwanda pakuyugha mundimi isingi, ngati mo u Mbepo akababusikisya.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Pakabako aba Yuda bo bakikalagha mu Yelusalemu, na bandu bosi bo bakwiputa u Chala, bo bakafuma mufikolo fyosi ifya pachisu icha pasi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Bo bifwa ichongo chila, ichilundilo ichikulu chikabungana. Bosi abandu bakaswigha, pakuti wesi umundu akifwa abitiki bakuyugha munjugha iyake. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Po bosi bakaswigha ngani sona chikabamala ngani amahala, bakayugha bakati, “Abandu aba, bosi bakuyugha teba Galileya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Imba sili buli ukuti twebosi twifwe bakuyughila munjugha yitu yo tukapapiwa nayo? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Twe bamo twafuma ku Palitiya, Mediya na Elamu, ku Mesopotamya, Yudeya na ku Kapadoniya, ku Pondi na Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ku Filigiya na Pamufiliya, ku chisu icha Ijiputi na muchigaba cha Libiya uwa Kileni, na bagheni aba kufuma ku Lomu, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />aba Yuda na bapanja bo bapindukila ku Chiyuda, sona twe twafuma ku Kileti na ku Alebiya, loli twebosi tukubifwa bakuyugha munjugha situ isya findu ifikulu fyo u Chala abombite!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bakaswigha ngani, sona chikabamala ngani amahala, bakayugha bene bene ukuti, “Imba ichi chikung’anamula choni?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Loli bamo bakabaseka abitiki nukuti, “Abandu aba bakoliswe ubwalwa bwa mafilu!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha Pitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Loli u Pitala akimilila poka na batumiwa abanine leveni bala, akakwesya amasyu ghake nukubabusya ukuti, “Mwe bandu ba mu Yuda na mwebosi mwe mukwikala mu Yelusalemu, teghelesya ku masyu gho tinjughaghe. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Abandu aba batakoliswe ukuyana namo mukubinong’onela, pakuti akabalilo aka ka nayini okoloko pangelo. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Mubuyo bwake sisisi syosyo sikayughiwa nu musololi u Yowelo po akati, <verse eid="ACT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />mumasiku ghabumalilo u Chala akuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">ngwisa pakupungulila u Mbepo wangu pa bandu bosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Abana binyu abanalume na bakolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bakwisa pakusolola amasyu ghangu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Abana abanalume bakwisa pakutesya ifisetuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">sona abaghosi bakwisa pakulota ifilota.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Po bope na bambombo bangu abanalume na bakolo ngwisa pakubapungulila u Mbepo wangu mumasiku ghala ghala, po bayukusolola amasyu ghangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ngwisa pakubomba ifika kumwanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">nukubomba ifiswigho pachisu cha pasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ibanda, umulilo ni lyosi ilingi,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />isuba likwisa pakuba nichisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">sona umwesi ghukwisa pakuba mukesamu ngati libanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">bo litafikite isiku lya Malafyale ikulu nilya koghofya.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Sona wesi yo akwitisya pilita lya Malafyale akwisa pakupokiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Mwe banalume bamu Izilayeli, teghelesya amasyu agha, u Yesu wa mu Nazaleti akaba mundu yo imbombo syake isya maka sikalangisiwa nukusimikisiwa nu Chala kukwinyu mufika fyosi ni fiswigho fyo u Chala akabombelagha mumwake. Umwe mwebene musimenye sisisi pakuti sikabombiwa pakati papinyu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat27.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Miko15.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk23.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Yoh19.18</ref>.</char></note> U Yesu akapeghiwa kukwinyu ukuyana namo u Chala akabatikila nu kwinong’onelapo nganila. Umwe mukamughogha pakumubika mu nyobe sya bambibi ukuti akomeliwe pambinjika. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mat28.5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Miko16.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luk24.5</ref>.</char></note>Loli u Chala akamususya kubufwe, nukumuleka musatuke kumaka gha bufwe, pakuti sitakaba syakuti singabombiwa ukuti ubufwe bumupote. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Pakuti u Devedi akuyugha isya yuyo akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Ngamutesya u Malafyale pamaso ghangu akabalilo kosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">ali kunyobe yangu indilo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">po ndangatamiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Pololi umoyo wangu ghuhobokite, sona ululimi lwangu lukusekelela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">po umubili wangu ghuyukuba nu lusubilo, <verse eid="ACT 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Pakuti utakwisa pakundeka muchisu cha bafwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">sona utasukwitikisya ukuti uwambombo wako umusubaliwa abolele mwipumba.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Undangisisye une isila sya bumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">sona ukwisa pakunyisusya nu lusekelo pamaso ghako.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Mwe bakamu bangu, mbaghile mbabusye pabwelu isya munyenya witu u Devedi, ukuti akafwa nukusiliwa, po ipumba lyake lili kuno nutwe mupaka pisiku ili. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Loli akaba musololi, sona akasimanya syo u Chala akapangana nawe mukufinga ukuti yumo uwaluko lwake akwisa pakupyana ubunyafyale bwake. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />U Devedi akatesya nganila, nukuyugha isya kusyuka kwa Kilisitu, ukuti atakalekiwa muchisu cha bafwe, po umubili wake ghutakabola mwipumba. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />U Yesu yuyu, u Chala akamususya ku bufwe, twebosi twe bakamboni ba findu fififi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />U Yesu akakwesiwa nukwikala ku nyobe indilo iya Chala, akapokela u Mbepo Mwikemo yo uwise akalaghisya, sona akapungulila cho umwe mukutesya nukwifwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Pakuti te we Davedi yo akakwela kumwanya, loli umwene akayugha akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“U Malafyale akati kwa Malafyale wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">ikala ku nyobe yangu indilo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mupaka po nabika abalughu bako ngati cha kukanyapo ifinama fyako.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Pololi aba munyumba ya Izilayeli bosi bamanyile nganila ukuti u Yesu yo mukamukomela pambinjika, weyo u Chala amubika pakuba we Malafyale, sona we Kilisitu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Bo abandu bifwa sisisi, sikabalasa mumoyo, po bakamulalusya u Pitala na batumiwa abangi bakati, “Bakamu bitu, imba tubombe choni?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Loli u Pitala akababusya akati, mupinduke nu kosiwa mwebosi mwi lita lya Yesu Kilisitu, ukuti muhobokeliwe ku mbibi sinyu, po mukwisa pakupokela ichabupi cha Mbepo Mwikemo. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Pakuti ipangano lili ku umwe, na ku bana binyu, na kubosi bo bali kubutali, na bosi bo u Malafyale u Chala witu ayukubitisya.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />U Pitala akababusya na masyu aghangi amingi aghakubasoka akati, “Mwipoke mwebene ku lufundo lo lukwisa pa bandu ababibi abangulilo iyi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Po bosi bo bakapokela amasyu ghake bakosiwa, po bakongelelapo abandu fili sabuzandi pisiku lila lila. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Bakiyipa bene ku fimanyilo fyo abatumiwa bakamanyisyagha, bakaba poka pakumenyannya ichibama na munyiputo.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubumi bwa bitiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Abandu bosi bakisula nu bogha chifukwa cha fika nifiswigho fyo fikabombiwagha na batumiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Abitiki bosi bakendelela pakuba poka, nukubeghana ifindu fyo bakaba nafyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bakaghulisya imighunda yabo na fyosi fyo bakaba nafyo nukugaba indalama ukuyana namo umundu wesi akasobelwagha. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Po isiku ni siku bakakomanagha poka munyumba ya Chala, nukumenyannya ichibama munyumba syabo sona bakalya nulusekelo mumyoyo iya kwiyisya, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />pakupalisya u Chala, nu kuba nichisa ku bandu bosi. Po isiku lyosi u Malafyale akongelesyagha ku kabukutila kabo abandu bo bakapokiwagha.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ukupola kwa mulemale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Isiku limo u Pitala nu Yohani bakabukagha ku nyumba ya Chala, pakabalilo ka kwiputa muma fili okoloko pamasuba. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Po umundu yumo yo akapapiwa mulemale ukufuma mo akapapiliwa, akanyamuliwagha akabalilo kosi nukubikiwa pa mulyango wa Nyumba ya Chala gho bakati Mwisa, ukuti asume ifyabupe ku bandu bo bakwingila mu Nyumba ya Chala. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Bo amutesya u Pitala nu Yohani bakwingila mu Nyumba ya Chala, akabasuma ukuti bamupeko chimo. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Po u Pitala nu Yohani bakamulolelesya, po u Pitala akamubusya akati, “Tutesye utwe.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Po umundu yula akabalolelesya nukusubila ukuti pamo tapokele chimo kukwabo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Loli u Pitala akamubusya akati, isiliva nu golide fyo ndenafyo, loli fyo indi nafyo fyo ngukupa, mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu uwa mu Nazaleti nyamuka endagha.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Po akamukola ninyobe yake indilo nukumunyamusya, papapo na papapo inyayo nu tupulung’unyu fikaba namaka. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Umwene akanyela nukwimilila, akanda pakwenda, nukwingila nabo poka mu Nyumba ya Chala bo akwenda nukunyela nyela, nu kumupala u Chala. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Bo abandu bosi bakumutesya akwenda nukumupala u Chala, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />bakamumanya ukuti weyo akikalagha pa Mulyango Umwisa uwa Nyumba ya Chala nukusuma suma. Bosi bakaswigha ngani, nukusukumila pacho chikabombiwa ku mundu yula.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha Pitala mu Nyumba ya Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Bo umundu yula amukakamile u Pitala nu Yohani, abandu bosi bakaswigha nukukindila poka pakwisa ku kwabo mu mbenu yo bakatingi mbenu ya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Bo u Pitala abatesya abandu, akababusya akati, “Mwe ba Izilayeli, imba choni cho mukuswigha nasisi, sona choni cho mukutulolelesya? Imba mukwinong’ona ukuti twetwe twamwendesya umundu uyu namaka ghitu, pamo nukwiputa kwa Chala witu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />U Chala wa Abulahamu, Ayizeki nu Yakobo, u Chala wa batata bitu, yo akamughindika umubombi wake u Yesu. Loli mukamubika munyobe sya balughu nukumukana pamaso pa Pilati, napo u Pilati akalondagha pakumusatula. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat27.15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:6-14">15.6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk23.13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Yoh19.12-15</ref>.</char></note> Loli umwe mukamukana u Mwikemo sona umugholoke, nukusuma umundu u mufyeka ukuti asatuliwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mukamughogha yo akupa ubumi, loli u Chala akamusyusya kubufwe. Utwe twe bakamboni pa sisisi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Chifukwa cha lwitiko mwilita lya Yesu, lyamupa amaka umundu uyu mukumutesya sona mu mumenye, po ulwitiko loluli mumwake lolo lwa muposya umundu uyu mukumutesya mwebosi. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Pololi bakamu bangu, simenye ukuti mukabomba ukusita kumanya, ngati balongosi binyu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Loli u Chala akayughila nganila ku basololi bosi ukuti u Kilisitu atamiwe, sona sikakwanilisiwa bubu. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Mupinduke ku imbibi sinyu nukunyokela kwa Chala, ukuti asimye imbibi sinyu. Pala mukubomba bubu u Malafyale akwisa pakubapa akabalilo akakutusikisya, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />sona akwisa pakubatumila u Yesu Kilisitu yo akabasalila nganila. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />U Yesu abaghile pakupokeliwa kumwanya mupaka akabalilo kakwane akakuyannya ifindu fyosi, ukuyana namo u Chala akayughila ku basololi bake abikemo ukufuma bo bwandilo. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Pakuti u Mozesi akati, “U Malafyale u Chala winyu akwisa pakumwimika u musololi mubakamu binyu, ngati mo akanyimikila une. Mubaghile pakumwifwila mufyosi fyo akuyugha numwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Po wesi yo atakumwifwila u musololi yula yula, yo ayukusabuliwako ku bandu bake. <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Loli bosi abasololi ukwandila pa Samuwelo na bosi bo bakisa panyuma pake, bope bakafumusya syo sikubombiwa mumasiku ghagha. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Umwe muli bana ba basololi, sona mwe ba lufingo lo u Chala akafinga na batata binyu, nukumubusya u Abulahamu ukuti, ‘Ukwendela muluko lwako abandu bosi muchisu ichapasi bakwisa pakusayiwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Bo u Chala amususya kubufwe umubombi wake, akamutuma tasi ku kwinyu, pa kubasaya umwe, ukuti wesi apinduke kusila syake isya mbibi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">U Pitala nu Yohani pamaso pa balongi aba Chiyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Bo u Pitala nu Yohani bakali bakuyugha na bandu, abaputi nu mulindilili wa Nyumba ya Chala naba Sadukayi bakisa ku kwabo. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bakakalala chifukwa chakuti abatumiwa bakamanyisyagha abandu nukufumusya mwa Yesu isya kusyuka ku bufwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Po bakabakola nukubighalila mujela mupaka ningelo lyake, pakuti chikaba cha pamasuba kale. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Loli abingi bo bakifwa amasyu bakasubila, sona ubwingi bwa banalume bukongelelapo ngati fayivi sabuzandi.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ningelo lyake abalongosi ba Chiyuda, abasongo na bamanyisi aba Ndaghilo bakabungana mu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Bakakomana nu muputi usongo ngani u Anasi nu Kayafa, nu Yohani, nu Alikizandala, sona na bosi bo bakaba muluko lwa muputi usongo ngani. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Po bakabimika abatumiwa pakati, nukubalalusya ukuti, “Imba mukubomba buli chichichi? Imba maka ghaki, pamo mwilita lya wenu lyo mwabombela isi?<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />U Pitala bo iswile nu Mbepo Mwikemo, akabamula akati, “Mwe balongosi ba bandu na basongo, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />pala tukulongiwa umusughu nisya mbombo inyisa yo yabombiwa pa mundu umulemale namo akapolela, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />po mwebosi musimanye na bandu ba mu Izilayeli bosi, ukuti mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu uwa mu Nazaleti yo umwe mukamukomelela pambinjika, yo u Chala akamususya kubufwe, ukwendela muyuyu, umundu uyu imilile pamaso pinyu apolite. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />U Yesu yuyuyu yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">libwe lyo likakaniwa namwe basengi ba nyumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">lyo likipela kuwa libwe lya pakona.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Po butalipo nabumo ubupoki mu mundu yumo, pakuti atalipo nayumo sona pachisu chosi ichapasi yo u Chala atupile twe bandu ukuti angatupoka.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Loli bo batesya ubukifu bwa Pitala nu Yohani, sona bo basyaghannya ukuti bakaba bandu bubu, abasita kumanyila, bakaswigha nu kusyaghannya ukuti bobo bakaba nu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Loli bo bamutesya umundu yo akapola imilile poka nu Pitala nu Yohani, po batakabanacho icha kuyugha nu kususya. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Po bakababusya ukuti bafumemo munyumba yo bakalongelaghamo inongwa, po bakanda pakuyughisannya bene bene ukuti, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Imba tubombe choni na bandu aba? Pakuti abandu bosi mu Yelusalemu basimenye ukuti ichiswigho ichikulu ichi chabombiwa nabo, sona tutangachikana. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Loli ukuti akapango aka manyekasate ku bandu, satuboghofye ukuti batakayughepo sona ku yumo mwilita lya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Po bakabitisya nu kubakomelesya ukuti batakayughepo pamo ukumanyisya mwilita lya Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Loli u Pitala nu Yohani bakamula bakati, “Pala chisa pamaso gha Chala ukubifwila umwe ukukila ukumwifwila u Chala, po mulonge mwebene, <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />pakuti tutangaleka utwe pakuyugha syo twatesya nukwifwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Abene bo bakongelelapo pakuboghofya, po bakabasatula pakuti batakachagha ichifukwa cha kubafunda, pakuti abandu bosi bakamupala u Chala pafyo fikabombiwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Pakuti umundu yo ichiswigho chikabombiwa icha kupola, akaba nifinja ifya kukila pa fote.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitiki bakwiputa ukuti babe bakifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bo u Pitala nu Yohani basatuliwa, bakanyokela kubanine nukubabusya syo aba longosi ba baputi na balongosi ba chiyuda syo bakayugha kukwabo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Bo bifwa sisisi, bosi bakakwesya amasyu kwa Chala nukuti, “Wee Malafyale,” Ukapela kumwanya ni chisu chapasi, sona ninyanja nafyosi fyo filimo, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />we ukayugha mwa Mbepo Mwikemo ukwendela mu mulomo mwa tata witu u Devedi umubombi wako, ukati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Choni cho abapanja bakupwata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Na bandu bakinong’ona syo site nimbombo.<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Abamalafyale ba muchisu cha pasi bakiyannya bene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">sona abalongosi bakabungana poka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">pakumusambukila u Malafyale nu Kilisitu wake.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Luk23.7-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Miko15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk23.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Yoh18.28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:29">29</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pakuti naloli u Helodi nu Pontiyo Pilati bakabungana mu kaya akakulu ngani poka na bandu aba panja, sona nabandu aba mu Izilayeli pakumusambukila u Yesu, umubombi wako umupakasiwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Bakabomba fyosi fyo uwe na maka ghako nu bwighane bwako ukinong’ona kale ukuti fibombiwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Po ipano Malafyale, tesya ukoghofya kwabo, ubape ababombi bako ukuyugha isyu lyako nubukifu bosi, <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />bo ukugholosya inyobe yako pa kuposya, sona witikisye ukuti ifimanyilo ni fiswigho fibombiwe mwilita lya Yesu, umubombi wako umwikemo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bo bamala pakwiputa, ubuyo bo bakakomanako bukayingana, po bosi bakisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo, po bakayugha isyu lya Chala nubukifu.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitiki bakugabana ifindu fyabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Po ichilundilo chosi icha bitiki chikaba nu moyo ghoka sona ni nyinong’ona syoka, po atakabapo nayumo uwa kuyugha ukuti ifindu fyo ali nafyo fyake mwene, loli bakagabana fyosi fyo bakaba nafyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Po abatumiwa bakasimikisya na maka amakulu ngani isya kusyuka kubufye bwa Malafyale u Yesu, po pakaba ichisa ichikulu ngani papabo bosi, <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Pakuti atakabapo nayubo uwa kutamiwa chimo, pakuti wesi akaba nimighunda pamo inyumba syo bakaghulisyagha nukwisa nindalama pafyo baghulisya. <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />Po bakasibika mu maka gha batumiwa, sona sikagabiwa ukuyana namo wesi akusobelwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Po u Jozefu uwaluko lwa Levi uwa mu Sayipulasi, yo abatumiwa bakamwitisya ukuti Balanabasi (Cho chikung’anamula ukuti, “Mwana walukasyo,”) <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />akaghulisya umughunda wake nu kwisa ni ndalama, nukusibika mu maka gha batumiwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">U Ananiya nu Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Loli umundu yumo ilita lyake akaba we Ananiya, yo poka nu mukasi wake u Safila bakaghulisya umughunda wabo ghumo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Loli akifwana nu mukasi wake, nukusabulapo indalama simo syo bakaghulisya umughunda wabo nukubapa abatumiwa syo sikasyala. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Po u Pitala akamubusya akati, “Imba Ananiya, choni cho ukamwitikisya u Satana ukuti ingile mumoyo wako nukumusimbula u Mbepo Mwikemo pakusabulapo indalama simo syo ukaghulisya umughunda wako? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Bo utaghulisisye umughunda ghula ghula, imba ghutakaba wako? Sona bo waghulisya, imba indalama sitakaba syako? Po choni cho ukinong’ona pakubomba sisisi? Utakabatamandila abandu, loli wamutamandila u Chala.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bo u Ananiya ifwa sisisi, akawa pasi nu kufwa. Sona ubogha bukabakola ngani bosi bo bakifwa sisisi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Po abalumyana bakanyamuka nukughunnyembetela umufimba wake, bakanyamula nukubuka nagho pakusila.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Bo pakilapo ama awala matatu, wepe umukasi akingila mula mula ukusita kusimanya syo sikabombiwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Po u Pitala akamulalusya akati, “Mbusya, imba ghogho mutengo mwaghulisisye umughunda winyu? Po akamula akati, “Inga, tukaghulisya pa mutengo ghughugho.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Po u Pitala akamubusya akati, “Imba choni cho uwe nu mulume wako mukifwana pakumughela u Mbepo uwa Malafyale? Ifwa umulindo ghukwifwika pa mulyango, wabalumyana bo bali pakusila umulume wako, sona bakwisa pakunyamula nuwe!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Papapo na napapo akawila mufinama fya Pitala nukufwa. Po abalumyana bakingila mula mula, bakagha afwa kale. Po bakamunyamula nukubuka nawe pakusila pambali pa mulume wake. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Ichipanga chosi na bosi bo bakifwa sisisi, ubogha bukabakola.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifika ni fiswigho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ifimanyilo ni fiswigho fikabombiwa mu bandu ni nyobe sya batumiwa. Po bosi bakaba nu moyo ghoka mu mbenu ya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Atakabapo nayumo yo akaba mukifu umoyo ukulumikisannya nabo, loli abandu bakabaghindika ngani. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Loli ubwingi bwa bandu bukongelelapo ku kabukutila kachilundilo cha banalume na bakolo bo bakamusubila u Malafyale, <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />umwakuti bakabanyamulagha ababine pakubuka nabo mumbali mu tusila, babalambalikite pa fitala na mumabulili, umwakuti umusyesye wa Pitala ghungabawila bamo bo akapulusannya. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Po sona ichilundilo cha abandu chikisa chabungana poka ukufuma mutwaya utukulu to tusyunguliwe nu Yelusalemu, bo bakwisa nababine, nabo bakaba nimipepo imibibi, po bosi bakapola.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abatumiwa bakufwimiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Po umuputi usongo poka na bosi bo akabanabo aba mukabukutila ka ba Sadukayi bosi, bakisula nakabini. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bakabakola abatumiwa nukubighalila mujela. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Loli ubusiku bula bula uwandumi wa Malafyale akighula imilyango ya jela nu kubafumya panja, nu kubabusya ukuti, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Bukagha nu kwimilila mu nyumba ya Chala nu kubabusya abandu nisya bumi ubupya.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bo bifwa sisisi, bakingila mu nyumba ya Chala pangelo ngelo nu kwanda pa kumanyisya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Po umuputi usongo na banine bo akaba nabo, akabungannya abalongosi ba Chiyuda poka na basongo bosi aba mu Izilayeli ku lukomano ulwa balongi, po bakabatuma abandu kujela ukuti bise nabo abatumiwa pamaso papabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Loli bo abandu bala bafika, batakabaghamo mujela, po bakanyokela nukubabusya abalongi ukuti, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Bo twafika kujela, tukayagha yighaliwe ngani, sona bope abalindili bakaba maso pamulyango, loli bo twighula, tutakamwaghamo nayumo mukati.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Bo bifwa amasyu ghagha, umulindili wa Nyumba ya Chala na balongosi ba baputi, bakalangana ngani nu kuswigha ukuti syabombiwa buli sisisi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Po akisa yumo nukubabusya ukuti, “Tesya, abandu bala mukababika mujela bali mu Nyumba ya Chala bimilile nu kumanyisya abandu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Po umulindili akabuka poka na bandu bake pakubasenya abatumiwa. Loli batakabombesyapo amaka, pakuti bakoghopagha abandu ukuti bangabakoma namabwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bo bisa na batumiwa mula mula, bakabimika pamaso pa balongi, po umuputi usongo akabalalusya akati, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tukabakanisya ngani ukuti mutakamanyikisye mwilita ili, po tesya, mwisusya akaya kosi nifimanyilo fyinyu, sona mukulonda pakubika ibada lya mundu uyu papitu!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Po u Pitala na batumiwa bamo bakamula bakati, “Tubaghile ukumwifwila u Chala ukukila abandu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />U Chala wa banyenya witu akamususya u Yesu, yo umwe mukamughogha nukumupayika pambinjika. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />U Chala akamukwesya ninyobe yake indilo ukuti abe mulongosi sona mupoki, ukuti abape ulupinduko aba Izilayeli nu kuhobokeliwa ku mbibi syabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Po utwe twe bakamboni kufindu fififi, sona nu Mbepo Mwikemo, yo u Chala akabapa bosi bo bakumwifwila.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Loli bo abalongosi ba Chiyuda bifwa sisisi, bakakalala ngani nu kulonda ukuti baghoghiwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Loli umu Falisayi yumo yo akaba we Gamaliyeli, umumanyisi wa ndaghilo, yo akaghindikiwa ngani na bandu bosi, akimilila nu kulamula ukuti abatumiwa babafumye kusi pakabalilo kapala bubu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Po akababusya akati, “Mwee ba mu Izilayeli, muchebe nasyo mukulonda pakubabombela abandu bababa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Pakuti mumasiku aghakunyuma u Teyudasi akabonekela, akiyugha mwene ngati wapamwanya, umwakuti abandu papipi ngati folo handeledi bakamukongagha, loli akaghoghiwa, sona abakongi bake bakanyambana, po akabukutila kake kakamala pala pala. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Panyuma pa uyu, u Yudasi uwa mu Galileya akaboneka pakabalilo ko abandu bakasimbisyagha, akabannyengelela abandu ukuti bamukonge. Loli wepe akaghoghiwa sona bosi bo bakamukongagha bakanyambanika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Pololi, ipano ngubabusya ukuti mutakababombele nachimo abandu bababa. Mubaleke babuke, pakuti pala syo babatikite pamo ukubomba sikufuma ku bandu, bakwisa pakupotwa, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:15">Luk21.15</ref>.</char></note> loli pala sikufuma kwa Chala mutangabapota, mukwisa pakwaghiwa mwebene ukuti mukulimbana nu Chala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Abalongi bakifwila syo u Gamaliyeli akayugha. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Po bakabitisya abatumiwa ukuti bingile mula mula, bakabasyemba nu kubakanisya ukuti batakayughile sona mwilita lya Yesu, po bakabasatula. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Po abatumiwa bakafumapo pamaso gha balongi, bakahoboka ukuti babaghile ukutamiwa chifukwa cha lita lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Po amasiku ghosi, mu Nyumba ya Chala na munyumba sya bandu batakaleka pakumanyisya nu kulumbilila Amasyu Amisa ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ukusaliwa kwa bafwilisi seveni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mu masiku ghala ghala, ubwingi bwa bamanyili bukanda pakubalila balila, aba Yuda bamu Giliki bakadandabulagha na bayuda aba mu Hebeli chifukwa chakuti bakalufyagha pakubapakisya abafwilwe pafyakulya fya isiku ni siku. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Po abatumiwa twelevu bakitisya ichilundilo cha bamanyili nukubabusya ukuti, “Chite chisa ukuti utwe tuleke pakulumbilila amasyu gha Chala nukuti twikolesannye pakubeghannya icha kulya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Pololi, bakamu bitu, musale abanalume seveni mumwinyu, bo biswile nu Mbepo Mwikemo na mahala, bobo tubabike pa mbombo iyi. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Loli utwe tukuya pakwiyula mukwiputa na kumbombo yakulumbilila amasyu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Po amasyu gho bakayugha ichilundilo chosi chikahoboka nagho, po bakasala u Sitefani, umundu yo akisula nulwitiko sona nu Mbepo Mwikemo, nu Filipu, nu Pulokolasi, nu Nikanoli, nu Timoni, nu Palimela, nu Nikolayi, umundu yo ate mu Yuda uwa mukaya ka Andiyokiya yo akapindukila ku Chiyuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Po bakisa na bandu bala pamaso gha batumiwa, bo bakabiputila nukubabika inyobe papabo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Po amasyu gha Chala ghakasata, nubwingi bwa bamanyili bukongelelapo ngani pakubala mu Yelusalemu, sona abaputi abingi bakifwila ulwitiko lwabo.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukukoliwa kwa Sitefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />U Sitefani, umundu yo akisula nichisa na maka, akabomba ifiswigho ni fimanyilo ifikulu mu bandu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Loli abandu bakamususya bo bakaba ba munyumba yakwiputilamo iya bandu ababuke (ngati mo bakitikisyagha) na ba Yuda aba mu Kileni, naba Alekizandiliya, nabo bakafuma ku Silisiya naba ku Asiya, bakasusannya nu Sitefani. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Loli bakapotwa pakususannya nawe pakuti akayughagha na mahala agha mwa Mbepo Mwikemo. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Po bakabanyengelela abandu bamo kubusyefu ukuti baye bayughe ukuti, “Tukamwifwa umundu uyu akuyugha amasyu ghakumusamula u Mozesi nu Chala.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Po bakabasambulannya abandu, abasongo na bamanyisi abandaghilo. Bakamukola u Sitefani nukwisa nawe pamaso gha balongi, <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />bakabika abakamboni abamyasi ukuti bamutamandile u Sitefani, bo bakayugha ukuti, “Umundu uyu atakuleka pakuyugha amasyu gha kutuka Inyumba ya Chala sona ni ndaghilo sya Mozesi. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Pakuti tukamwifwa akuyugha akuti, u Yesu uwa mu Nazaleti uyu akwisa pakunangannya amalo nu kwandula imiteto yo u Mozesi akatupa!”<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bosi bo bakikala pa malo gha balongi bakamulolelesya u Sitefani, sona bakatesya icheni chake ngati cho cheni cha wandumi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha Sitefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Po umuputi usongo akamulalusya u Sitefani akati, “Imba isi syabwanaloli?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Po u Sitefani akamula akati, “Mwee bakamu bangu na batata, muteghelesye! U Chala uwa bughindikiwa akamubonekela utata u Abulahamu bo ali muchisu cha Mesopotamiya, bo akali atabukite muchisu cha Halani, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />po akamubusya akati, ‘Fumamo muchisu chinyu na kubakamu bako, ubuke ku chisu cho nguya pakulangisya uwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Po akafumamo muchisu cha Akaladeya nukubuka pakwikala mu Halani. Bo uwise afwa, u Chala akamusamikisya muchisu ichi, cho umwe mukwikalamo losulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Atakamupako napo buyo ubwakuti apyane ukuti bube bwake, napo katamba koka, loli u Chala akapangana pakumupako ichisu ichi, sona ukuti chibe chake nuluko lwake lolukumukonga, napo atakaba nu mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />U Chala akayugha nawe musila iyi, abaluko lwako bakwisa pakwikala muchisu icha chigheni, kula kula bayukuba basya nu kubayifya ifinja folo handeledi. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />‘Loli ngwisa pakubafunda abandu bo bakwisa pakubombelagha ngati basya, panyuma pake bakwisa pakufumamo muchisu chila chila nu kunyiputa pabuyo ubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Po akamupa u Abulahamu ipangano lya kusilimula, po u Abulahamu akapapa u Ayizeki, akasilimuliwa bo pakilapo usabata weka ukwandila pisiku lyo akapapiwa. U Ayizeki akapapa u Yakobo, po u Yakobo akapapa abanyenya bitu twelovu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Po abana ba Yakobo bala bakaba nakabini nu wamwabo u Jozefu, bakamughulisya ngati musya mu Ijiputi, loli u Chala akaba nawe, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Nukumupoka kundamyo syake syosi, akamupa ichisa namahala pamaso pa Falabo umalafyale wa mu Ijiputi. Po u Falabo akamubika u Jozefu pakuba mulaghili wa mu Ijiputi napa nyumba yake yosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Po isala yikawa muchisu chosi icha mu Ijiputi nu Kenani, yo yikisa ni ndamyo ingulu ngani, umwakuti abanyenya bitu bakapotwa pakuchagha ichakulya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Bo u Yakobo ifwa ukuti muli ichakulya mu Ijiputi, akabatuma abanyenya bitu pa bulendo ubwakwanda. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Pa bulendo bwabo ubwabubili u Jozefu akilangisya mwene ku bawamwabo bake, po uluko lwa Jozefu lukamanyikwa kwa Falabo. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Po u Jozefu akatuma kwa wise u Yakobo, pakumubusya ni nyumba yake yosi, abandu bosi poka bakaba sevenite fayivi ukwisa ku Ijiputi. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Po u Yakobo akabuka ku Ijiputi, ko akafwila kuko poka na banyenya bitu, <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Imifimba yabo yikanyamuliwa ku Sekemu, mo bakabasila mwipumba lyo u Abulahamu akaghula ni ndalama ku bana ba Hamoli mu Sekemu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Loli bo akabalilo kakwana akakuti u Chala abombe ipangano lyo akapangana nu Abulahamu, abandu bitu mu Ijiputi bakabala ngani, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />ukufika po akabonekelagha umalafyale uyungi mu Ijiputi, yo atakamumanya u Jozefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Umwene akabenda pasi abaluko lwitu, nukubafyenga abatata ukuti bataghe aba bonda babo ukuti bafwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Kakaba kabalilo ko u Mozesi akapapiwa, umwana umumoghi ngani. Akaleliwa mu nyumba ya wise imyesi mitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />bo ataghiwa, umwana wa Falabo umulindu akamuseba nukumulela ngati mwana wake. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Po bakamumanyisya u Mozesi amahala ghosi agha mu Ijiputi, sona akaba wamaka mu masyu na mumbombo syake. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Bo u Mozesi afika ifinja fote, akinong’ona pakubendela abakamu bake, abana ba Izilayeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Akatesya yumo uwa mu chisu cha Ijiputi akumuyifya yumo umukamu wake, akabuka pakumupoka nukutanisya pakumughogha umundu wa mu Ijiputi. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />U Mozesi akinong’ona ukuti abakamu bake bakasyaghannya ukuti u Chala akamutuma pa kubapoka mundamyo syabo, loli batakamanyagha. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Po ilya ningelo lyake akabatesya abanya Izilayeli babili bakulwa bene bene, akaghesya pakubamanyannya. Akayugha akati, ‘Mwe banalume, mwe bana mundu, po imba choni cho mukulwa bububu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Loli yo akamubombela umunine ichibibi, akamusungila u Mozesi kumbali nukumulalusya ukuti, ‘Imba wenu yo akakubika uwe pakuba mulongosi sona mulongi pakati pitu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Imba ukulonda pakungogha ukuyana namo ukamughoghela umundu wa mu Ijiputi yula mumasuba?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Bo u Mozesi ifwa sisisi, akakinda mu Ijiputi nukubuka pakwikala muchisu cha Midiyani. Kula kula akapapako abana babili.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Bo fyakilapo ifinja fote, uwandumi uwa kumwanya akamubonekela u Mozesi mu katengele akakwaka umulilo mulungalangala papipi nighamba lya Sinayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Bo u Mozesi atesya isi, akaswigha nafyo fikaboneka po akapalamila papipi ukuti aye atesye. Loli akifwa isyu lya Malafyale likuti, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Une ne Chala uwa batata binyu, u Chala wa Abulahamu nu wa Ayizeki, nu wa Yakobo. U Mozesi akatetema nubogha, sona atakayimba pakutesyako. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Po u Malafyale akamubusya akati, ‘Fula isapato kufinama fyako, pakuti ubuyo bo wimililepo malo mikemo. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Natesya naloli ukutamiwa kwa bandu bangu aba mu Ijiputi. Nifwa ukudandabula kwabo, sona nisa pakubapoka. Sakuno losulu ukuti ngutume ku Ijiputi.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“U Mozesi we yuyo aba mu Izilayeli bakamukana, nukuti, ‘Imba wenu yo akamubika pakuba mulongosi sona mulongi pakati pitu?’ Sona we yuyo u Chala akamutuma ukuti abe mulongosi sona mupoki ukwendela mu wandumi wa kumwanya yo akamubonekela mu katengele. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Weyo akabatangilila abandu ukufumamo mu Ijiputi, akabombagha ifiswigho ni fimanyilo mu Ijiputi na pa Nyanja Ingesamu, sona na mungolongo ifinja fote. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />U Mozesi weyo akababusya aba mu Izilayeli ukuti, ‘U Chala akwisa pakubatumila u Musololi ukuyana namo akandumila une, ukufuma mu bandu binyu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Weyo akaba muchipanga mungolongo poka nu wandumi yo akayugha nawe pighamba lya Sinayi, bo ali poka na batata bitu, yo akapokela amasyu amumi ukuti atupe utwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Loli aba tata bitu bakakana pakumwifwila, loli bakamusungila kumbali nu kunyokela kunyuma mu myoyo yabo ku Ijiputi, <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />bakayugha nu Aloni bakati, ‘Utupangile abachala bo bakwisa pakututangilila utwe, pakuti u Mozesi yo akatufumya mu Ijiputi, tutakumanya cho chapangiwa ku kwake. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Po mumasiku ghala ghala bakapanga ichifwani cha kawata nukubika ifyabupe ku chifwani chila chila, bakasekela nimbombo ya nyobe syabo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Loli u Chala akabafwituka, nukubapa abene ukuti biputaghe bubu kundondwi isya kumwanya, ukuyana namo sisimbiliwe mwibuku lya musololi ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Imba mwabika ifinyamana kwa une fyo fighoghiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">nu kubika ifyabupi ifinja fote mungolongo, mwe bamu nyumba ya Izilayeli?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Po mukasenya ichisakasa cha Moleki, nu lutondwi ulwa chala winyu u Lefani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">fifwani fyo mukapanga ukuti mufyiputaghe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Po ngwisa pakubasamikisya ku butali ni chisu cha Babeloni.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Abatata bitu bakaba ni chisakasa chakusimikisya mungolongo, mo yo akayughagha nu Mozesi, akamulaghila ukusenga ichisakasa ukuyana nichifwani cho akachitesya. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Panyuma pake abanyenya bitu bakachipokela ichisakasa chila ku batata babo. Bakachinyamula, bo bakubuka nu Yoswa pakufyula ichisu ku bapanja mo u Chala akabakisyangamo pamaso pa batata babo. Chikikala mula mula ukufika mu masiku gha Devedi, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />yo akachagha ichisa pamaso pa Chala sona akasumagha ubuyo bwakwikalamo u Chala wa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Loli akaba we Solomoni yo akamusengela inyumba. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Loli uwa Pamwanya Ngani atakwikala munyumba syo sisengiwe ninyobe sya bandu, ngati mo umusololi akayughilagha ukuti,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Kumwanya cho chitengo changu icha bunyafyale, sona ichisu ichapasi chakukanyapo ifinama fyangu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Imba nyumba yiki yo mungasengela, akayugha u Malafyale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">pamo ubuyo bo imbaghile pakwikalamo buli ko kwighi? <verse eid="ACT 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Imba te nyobe yangu yipanga ifindu fyosi fififi?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Mwe bakafu imyoyo umwe! Mwe imyoyo yinyu na makutu ghinyu ghali ngati bo bandu bo batakasilimuliwa, akabalilo kosi umwe mukukana u Mbepo Mwikemo, ngati mobakabombelagha abatata binyu, momo numwe mukubombela. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Imba kukabako umusololi yumo yo abatata binyu batakamuyifyapo? Bakabaghogha awandumi ba Chala bo bakafumusyagha ngani isya kwisa kwa mugholoke. Po ulu mwamubika munyobe sya balughu nukumughogha, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />umwe mwemwe mukapokela indaghilo ngati mo chikapeghiwa na bandumi, loli mutakasisunga.<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakumukoma u Sitefani na mabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Bo abalongi bifwa kwa Sitefani, bakakalala nukusyeketula amino. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Loli nu bwisule bwa Mbepo Mwikemo, u Sitefani akatesya kumwanya nukutesya ubughindikiwa bwa Chala, sona nu Yesu imilile kunyobe indilo iya Chala. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Akati, Tesya, ngutesya kumwanya kwighukite, nu Mwana wa Mundu imilile kunyobe indilo iya Chala.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Loli abene bakakuta nisyu lya pamwanya nu kwighalila amakutu ghabo nu kumunyelela bosi poka. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Po bakamughusila kusi kwa kaya kala nu kumukoma na mabwe, abakamboni bakasungisya amalaya ghabo ku mulumyana ilita lyake we Sabuli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Bo bakwendelela pakumukoma na mabwe, u Sitefani akiputa akati, “Wee Malafyale Yesu, pokela u mbepo wangu.”<verse eid="ACT 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Po akafughamila pasi nukulila nisyu lya pamwanya ukuti, “We Malafyale, utakabape inongwa pa mbibi syabo isi.” Bo ayugha sisi akafwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Po u Sabuli akitikisya ukughoghiwa kwa Sitefani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">U Sabuli akuchifwima ichipanga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Isiku lila lila ichipanga cha mu Yelusalemu chikanda pakufwimiwa ngani. Po abitiki bosi ukupatula abatumiwa, bakabanyambannya mu fingaba fyosi ifya Yudeya nu Samaliya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Abandu bo bakamwiputa u Chala bakamusila u Sitefani, nukumulila ngani ni chitima. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Imbo22.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref>.</char></note>Loli u Sabuli akaghesya pakunangannya ngani ichipanga, umwakuti akabukagha inyumba ni nyumba pakubakola abanalume na bakolo nukubighalila mujela.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu Amisa ghakulumbiliwa mu Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Abitiki bo bakanyambana posi na posi, bakalumbililagha Amasyu Amisa kosi ko bakabukagha. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />U Filipu akabuka mukaya akululu ngani aka mu Samaliya nukulumbilila ku bandu Amasyu Amisa agha Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Po ifilundilo fya bandu fikamwifwa u Filipu nu kutesya ifimanyilo fyo akabombagha, bosi bakateghelesya ngani syo akayugha. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Pakuti abingi mu bala bala bakaba nimbepo imbibi, syo sikafumagha bo bakukuta ngani, sona abingi bo bafwile ifinama na balemale bakapola. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Po mukaba ulusekelo ulukulu ngani mukaya kala kala.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Loli pakaba umundu yumo yo akaba we Simoni, yo kale akabaswighisya ngani abandu ba mu Samaliya na mayele ghake. Umwene akitufyagha ngati we mundu yumo umukulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Abandu bosi aba mukaya kala abapala na basongo, bakati, “Umundu uyu we maka agha Chala gho bakughitisya ukuti ‘Maka Amakulu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bakamuteghelesya ngani chifukwa chakuti akabalilo akatali akabaswighisya ngani na mayele ghake. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Loli bo bamusubila u Filipu yo akalumbililagha Amasyu Amisa agha Malafyale u Chala na mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu, po bakosiwa bosi abanalume na bakolo. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />U Simoni wepe akasubila. Bo osiwa, akikalagha poka nu Filipu, sona bo atesya ifimanyilo ni fiswigho ifikulu fyo fikabombiwagha, akaswigha.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Bo abatumiwa aba ku Yelusalemu bifwa ukuti abandu mu Samaliya bapokela amasyu gha Chala, bakabatumila u Pitala nu Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bo bafika, bakabiputila abitiki bala ukuti bapokele u Mbepo Mwikemo, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />pakuti wesi akaba atapokelite u Mbepo Mwikemo, loli bakosiwa bubu mwilita lya Malafyale u Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Po Pitala nu Yohani bakabika inyobe papabo, sona bakapokela u Mbepo Mwikemo.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Bo u Simoni atesya ukuti u Mbepo Mwikemo apeghiwa pakubabika inyobe abatumiwa, akabasenyela indalama u Pitala nu Simoni, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />nukubabusya ukuti, “Nune bubu mumbeko amaka, umwakuti wesi yo namubika inyobe apokele u Mbepo Mwikemo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Loli u Pitala akamwamula akati, “Uwe ni ndalama yako mupyutiwe poka, chifukwa ukwinong’ona ukuti ungaghula ichabupe cha Chala ni ndalama. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ute ni chigaba pamo ubuyo mumbombo yitu pakuti umoyo wako temwisa pamaso gha Chala. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Pololi pinduka nukuleka ichibibi chako ichi, nu kwiputa kwa Malafyale ukuti akuhobokele pacho ukwinong’ona mumoyo wako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Pakuti ngutesya ukuti wiswile nukubaba kwa kayongo, sona we musya wa mbibi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Po u Simoni akamula akati, “Munyiputile kwa Malafyale ukuti nachimo cho mwayugha chitakabombiwe pa une. <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Bo bamala pakusimikisya nukufumusya amasyu gha Malafyale, u Pitala nu Yohani bakanyokela mu Yelusalemu, nukulumbilila Amasyu Amisa mutwaya utwingi utwa mu Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Filipu ni Kambala lya mu Isopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Loli uwandumi wa Malafyale akamubusya u Filipu akati, “Nyamuka nukubuka kumbali iya kundende kusila yo yikubuka ku Gaza ukufuma mu Yelusalemu.” (Yo sila ya mulungalangala). <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Po u Filipu akanyamuka nukubuka. Akatesya umundu wa muchisu cha Isopiya, lyo likaba likambala lya kusunga ichuma cha malafyale umukolo u Kandaki uwa ku Isopiya, yo akisa ku Yelusalemu pakwiputa, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />po akabwela ku kaya, akikala mungolo yake, akabelengagha ibuku lya musololi u Yisaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Po u Mbepo Mwikemo akamubusya u Filipu akati, “Bukagha wende papipi ni ngolo iyi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Po u Filipu akakindilila ingolo yila nu kumwifwa akubelenga ibuku lya musololi u Yisaya. Akamulalusya akati, “Imba ukuchifwisya cho ukubelenga?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Po umwene akamula akati, “Imba ningifwa buli, po atalipo nayumo uwa kundingannya? Po akamwitisya u Filipu ukuti akwele nu kwikala nawe. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Amasimbo gho akabelenga gho agha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Ngati ng’osi yo yasenyiwa pakubuka nayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">pakuboliwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">pamo mwana wa ng’osi yo atakusuma ichongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">bo bali pakuputula ameya ghake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">po atakumetapo nakamo.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Bakamusula sona panongwa yake patakabapo ubwanaloli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Imba we wenu yo angalingannya nisya luko lwake?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Pakuti ubumi bwake pachisu ichapasi pano bwafika pabumalilo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ikambala lila likamubusya u Filipu likati, “Mbusya, imba umusololi akuyugha nisya wenu? Imba akwiyugha mwene pamo nisya yungi bubu?”<verse eid="ACT 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Po u Filipu akanda pakuyugha, ukwandila pamasimbo, akamubusya Amasyu Amisa agha Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bo bakwenda musila, bakafika pa buyo bumo bo pakaba amisi. Po ikambala lila likati, “Tesya pano pali amisi. Imba choni cho chingakanisya ukuti nosiwe?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amasimbo ghamo ghakongelesyapo vesi 37 Po u Filipu akamubusya akati, ‘Ubaghile pakosiwa pala ukusubila nu moyo wako ghosi. Po umwene akamula akati, “Ngusubila ukuti u Yesu Kilisitu Mwana wa Chala.”</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ikambala likalamula ukuti ingolo yake yimilile, po bosi babili bakingila mu misi, u Filipu ni kambala lila, po akamosya. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Bo bafumamo mu misi mula, u Mbepo wa Malafyale akamutisyapo u Filipu, po ikambala lila litakamutesyapo sona u Filipu, loli akendelela nubulendo bwake iswile nubuhoboke. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Loli u Filipu akaghiwa ku Azota. Po akubuka pakalumbilila Amasyu Amisa mutwaya tosi, mupaka ukufika ku Kesaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Ukupindika kwa Sabuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Imbombo22.6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4-16">Imbo22.4-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-18">26.9-18</ref>.</char>
    </note>Loli u Sabuli bo akali akufuta nubukalale bwa kuboghofya nu kubaghogha abamanyili ba Malafyale, akabuka ku Muputi usongo <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nukusuma abakalata ukuti abuke nabo munyumba sya kwiputilamo, umwakuti pala angabagha bamo bo bakukonga isila yiyiyo, abanalume pamo abakolo, abapinye nukwisa nabo ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Bo ali musila akupalamila ku kaya ka Damasika umwakukenusya bubu ubwelu bwa kufuma kumwanya bukamubalila. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Po akawa nukwifwa isyu likuyugha likuti, “Sabuli, Sabuli, choni cho ukufwima?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Po akalalusya akati, “Imba we wenu, Malafyale?” Akamula akati, “Ne Yesu yo ukumufwima, <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />loli nyamuka nukubuka mukaya akakulu ngani, mo bakwisa pakukubusya syo ubaghile pakubomba.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Abandu bo bakendagha nu Sabuli bakimilila bo syasoba isyakuyugha, bakifwa isyu loli batakamutesya nayumo. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Po u Sabuli akanyamuka ukufuma pasi, loli bo amaso ghighuka, atakatesya nachimo. Po bakamukola panyobe nu kubuka nawe mu Damasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Po akikala amasiku matatu ukusita ukutesya, sona atakalya pamo ukung’wa chimo.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Loli akabako umumanyili yumo mu Damasika yo akaba we Ananiya. Po u Malafyale akamwitisya muchisetuka ukuti, “Ananiya!” Akamula akati, “Indi pano Malafyale.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />U Malafyale akamubusya akati, “Nyamuka buka kusila yo bakuti ingoloke, po munyumba ya Yudasi uye ubusikisye umundu yumo ilita lyake we Sabuli, uwa ku Talisa, ali pakwiputa, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />po akamutesya umundu muchisetuka ilita lyake Ananiya, isa nukumubika inyobe ukuti atesye sona.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />U Ananiya akamwamula akati, “Malafyale, nifwa ukufuma ku bandu abingi bo bambusya nisya mundu uyu, ukuti akababombelagha ububibi abandu bako abikemo mu Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />po apeghiwa amaka na balongosi ba baputi agha kubapinya bosi bo bakwitisya ilita lyako.<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Loli u Malafyale akamubusya akati, “Bukagha, pakuti namusala pakuba chibombelo changu, icha kufumukisya ilita lyangu ku bapanja na ku banyafyale na ku bandu ba mu Izilayeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Pakuti une ngwisa pakumulangisya syosi indamyo syo abaghile pakutamiwa chifukwa cha lita lyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Po u Ananiya akabuka nu kwingila munyumba mo mukaba u Sabuli nukubika inyobe yake papake. Akati, “Wamwitu Sabuli, u Malafyale u Yesu, yo akakubonekela musila bo ukwisa, anduma ukuti utesye sona, nu kwisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Papapo na papapo utundu tumo tukawa mumaso to tukaba ngati tupapa twa swi, po akanda pakutesya sona, akanyamuka nukosiwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />bo alya ichakulya, akakaba amaka ghake.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">U Sabuli akulumbilila mu Damasika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Po u Sabuli akaba poka na bamanyili mu Damasika amasiku ghamo. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Po pala pala akanda pakulumbilila munyumba sya kwiputilamo ukuti u Yesu Mwana wa Chala.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Po bosi bo bakamwifwa sisisi, bakaswigha nukulalusya ukuti, “Ate weyuyo yo afulungannya mu Yelusalemu ku bosi bo bakwitisya ilita lilili? Imba atisile kuno kumbombo yila yila iyakubapinya abandu nukubabika munyobe sya baputi abasongo?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Loli ubulumbili bwa Sabuli bukendelela pakukula mu maka, umwakuti chikabamala ngani amahala aba Yuda bo bakikalagha mu Damasika pakubasimikisya ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2 Kol11.32</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo ghendapo amasiku amingi, aba Yuda bakapangana ukuti bamughoghe u Sabuli, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />loli u Sabuli akasimanya syo bakifwana mulubatiko lyabo. Po bakamulindililagha mumilyango yalupaso umusanya nu busi ukuti bamughoghe u Sabuli, <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />loli abamanyili bake bakamusenya ubusiku, nukumwingisya muchitundu ukwendela pibwindo lyo likaba palubumba lwa lupaso.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Sabuli mu Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />U Sabuli bo afika ku Yelusalemu akaghela pakongana na bamanyili, loli bosi bakamoghopa, pakuti batakasubilagha ukuti akaba mumanyili. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Loli u Balanabasi akamusenya nukubuka nawe ku batumiwa. Akabalingannya mo u Sabuli akamutesekesya u Malafyale musila, yo akayugha nawe ukuti mu Damasika akalumbililagha nu bukifu mwilita lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Po u Sabuli akikala nabo poka nukwenda mu Yelusalemu mosi pakuyugha nubukifu mwilita lya Malafyale. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Akayugha nu kususannya na ba Yuda bo bakayughagha ichigiliki, loli bakaghesya pa kumughogha. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Bo abitiki basyaghanya, bakamusenya u Sabuli nukubuka nawe mu Kesaliya nukumutuma ku Talisa.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Po ichipanga cha mu Yudeya, mu Galileya, na mu Samaliya mo kakaba kabalilo ka mutende nukwendelela pakumwiputa u Malafyale, sona nu Mbepo Mwikemo akachikasya nukuchafwa pakukula, po chikaba chakumoghopa u Malafyale.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pitala mukaya ka Lida nu Yopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Bo u Pitala akwenda posi na posi akabuka pakubendela abandu aba Chala, akisa afika na ku ba Kilisitu bo bakikalagha ku Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kula kula akamwagha umundu yo akaba we Eneya, yo akalemala sona akaghona pachitala ifinja Eyiti. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />U Pitala akamubusya akati, “Eneya, u Yesu Kilisitu akuposya, nyamuka alula ubulili bwako.” Po akanyamuka papapo na papapo. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Po bosi bo bakikalagha mu Lida na mu Shaloni bakamutesya, nu kupindukila kwa Malafyale.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Loli mu Yopa mukaba umumanyili umukolo yumo yo akaba we Tabita, lyo likughanamula ukuti Dolikasi, umukolo yuyuyu akabombagha imbombo inyisa akabalilo kosi, sona akabafwa abapina. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Po pakabalilo kala kala akabina nu kufwa, umufimba wake bakaghosya nukughulambalika muchipinda cho chikaba pamwanya pa chinine. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Pakuti akaya ka Lida kakaba papipi nakaya ka Yopa, abamanyili bakifwa ukuti u Pitala ali mu Lida, po bakabatuma abandu babili namasyu aghakuti, “Twalamba, endelela wise kuno.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Po u Pitala akanyamuka nukubuka poka nabo. Bo afika, bakabuka nawe kuchipinda ichapamwanya, mo abafwilwe bosi bakamubunganila nukulila, sona bakamulangisya amalaya nifyakufwala fyo u Dolikasi akasonagha bo akali mumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Loli u Pitala akabafumya bosi kusi, akafughamila pasi nukwiputa. Akaghalabukila ku mufimba nukuti, “Wee Tabita, nyamuka!” Po akighula amaso ghake, bo amutesya u Pitala, akanyamuka nukwikala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Po u Pitala akamukola inyobe nu kumunyamusya, po akabitisya abitiki bosi, poka nabafwilwe nukubalangisya u Tabita umumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Akapango kakasata mu Yopa mosi, po abandu abingi bakasubila mwa Malafyale. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />U Pitala akikala amasiku amingi mu Yopa mu nyumba ya Simoni umufukuta makwela.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">U Pitala nu Kolineliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kukabako umundu yumo mukaya ka Kesaliya, yo akaba we Kolineliya, u songo wa chilundilo cha basilikali cho bakati Itale. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Umwene akaba mundu wakwiputa, sona wakumoghopa u Chala ni nyumba yake yosi, akabapagha abandu abingi ifyabupi, nu kwiputa akabalilo kosi kwa Chala. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Isiku limo akabalilo ka fili okoloko pachapamasuba u Kolineliya akatesya ichisetuka, uwandumi wa Chala akwisa kukwake nukuyugha ukuti, “Kolineliya!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Po akamulolelesya nu koghopa, nukumulalusya ukuti, “Wee Malafyale, Imba cho choni ichi?” Po uwandumi akamula akati, “Inyiputo syako nifyabupi fyako fikwelite kumwanya ngati fyakukumbukilamo u Chala. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Po losulu ubatume abanalume mu Yopa, baye bamusenye umundu yumo yo we Simoni, yo bakuti we Pitala. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Akwikala pa nyumba ya Simoni, umufukuta makwela, yo inyumba yake yili mumbali mwa nyanja.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Bo uwandumi yo akayugha nawe abuka, u Kolineliya akabitisya abambombo bake babili nu musilikali uwa kumwiputa u Chala, yo akamubombelagha akabalilo kosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Bo abalingannya syosi syo sikabombiwagha, akabatuma ku Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ilya ningelo lyake, bo bali pabulendo bwabo, bakupalamila mu Yopa, u Pitala akakwela pakasale pakwiputa, bo isuba lili pamutu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Isala yikamubaba u Pitala, po akalonda chimo ichakuti alye, loli bo bali pakutendekesya ichakulya, akatesya ichisetuka. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Po akatesya kumwanya kwighukite, sona ichindu chimo cho chikaboneka ngati cho chimwenda ichikulu, cho chikakoliwa mumbali syosi folo chikwika pasi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mula mula mukaba ifinyamana ifya finama folo, nafyo fikwendela ifukwe, nifiyuni fya mu mwanya. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Po isyu likamubusya ukuti, “Pitala, nyamuka, ghogha ulye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Loli u Pitala akati, “Malafyale, awe, ndalile lumo fyo fili mwiko sona nafyo finyalite.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Po isyu likifwika sona ilya bubili likati, “Cho u Chala achipaghula ukuti chisa, utakinong’one ukuti chinyalite.”<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Sisisi sikabombiwa katatu, papapo na papapo ichimwenda chila chikasenyiwa pakunyokela kumwanya.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Bo u Pitala akuswigha nisya ching’anamulo cha findu fyo akatesya muchisetuka chila, abandu bo bakatumiwa nu Kolineliya bakamanya ko inyumba ya Simoni yikaba. Po bakimilila pamulyango wa lupaso. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Bakitisya nukulalusya pala alimo u Simoni, yo bakati Pitala.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Bo u Pitala akali akwinong’ona ichighanamulo cha chisetuka chila, u Mbepo akayugha kukwake akati, “Ifwa! Abandu batatu bali kuno bakulonda.” <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Po nyamuka bukagha nu kwika, po ubuke nabo kusita kukayikila pakuti nene nabatuma.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Po u Pitala akika nukubuka po abandu bala bakaba, akababusya akati, “Une nene mukundonda. Imba choni cho mwisa kuno?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bakamula bakati, “Usongo u Kolineliya, yo mundu mwisa uwa kumoghopa u Chala, sona aghindikiwe na ba Yuda bosi. Uwandumi umwikemo akamubusya ukuti akwitisye uwe ukuti ubuke ku nyumba yake, ukuti ifwe syo ukulonda pakuyugha.”<verse eid="ACT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Po u Pitala akabingisya mu nyumba abandu bala ukuba bagheni bake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Isiku ilingi akanyamuka nukubuka nabo, sona nabanine bamo abitiki abakufuma mu Yopa, bakabuka nawe.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Pangelo pake bakafika mu Kesaliya, ko u Kolineliya akamulindililagha, akabitisya abakamu bake na bamanyani bake.<verse eid="ACT 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Bo u Pitala akwingila mu nyumba, u Kolineliya akamupokela nu kuwa mufinama fyake, akamukwesya. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Loli u Pitala akamunyamusya nukuti, “Imilila, nune ne mundu bubu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Bo u Pitala akuyugha nu Kolineliya, akingila mu nyumba mo abandu abingi bakabungana. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Po akababusya akati, “Umwe mwebene musimenye ukuti mwiko umu Yuda pakomana pamo pakubuka ku bapanja, loli u Chala andangisisye ukuti indeke ukuyugha yumo umundu ukuti mwiko pamo anyalite. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Bo nitisiwa nuwe, ngisa ukusita kukana, po ngulonda ndalusye choni cho wanyitisya?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Po u Kolineliya akamula akati, “Amasiku matatu gho ghakilapo, pakabalilo ngati kaka, aka fili okoloko pachapamasuba, bo ngwiputa mu nyumba yangu, umwakukenusya bubu umundu akimilila pamaso pangu afwalite amalaya agha kunyikisila, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />akati, ‘Kolineliya, inyiputo syako sifwika, sona nifyabupi fyako fyakumbukiliwa pamaso gha Chala. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Pololi tuma abandu ku Yopa ukuti bamwitisye u Simoni yo bakumwitisya ukuti u Pitala, umugheni mu nyumba ya Simoni umufukuta makwela, yo akwikala mumbali mwa nyanja.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Papapo na papapo ngatuma abandu ku kwako, po chaba akisa pakuti wisa kuno. Pololi twebosi tuli pano pamaso gha Chala tukulindilila ukwifwa syosi syo u Malafyale akulaghile pakutubusya utwe.<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha Pitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Ukk10.17</ref>.</char>
    </note>Po u Pitala akanda pakuyugha akati, “Ipano nasyaghannya ukuti naloli u Chala atakusala umundu mo abelile, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />loli ifikolo fyosi, ku yo akumoghopa nu kubomba akisa, weyo mwene akumupokela. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mughamenye amasyu gho u Chala akabatumila abandu bamu Izilayeli, pakulumbilila Amasyu Amisa aghamutendele ukwendela mwa Yesu Kilisitu (yo we Malafyale wa bosi) <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mughamenye amasyu gho ghakafumusiwa mu Yudeya, ukwandila mu Galileya, bo u Yohani afuma bubu pakulumbilila isya losyo, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />namo u Chala akamupakasya u Yesu uwa mu Nazaleti nu Mbepo Mwikemo na maka, yo akabuka kosi nakosi, pakubomba inyisa nu kuposya bosi bo bakutamiwa nu satana, pakuti u Chala akaba nawe. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Nutwe twe bakamboni ba fyosi fyo akabomba mu Izilayeli na mu Yelusalemu. Bakamughogha pakumupayika pambinjika. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Loli u Chala akamusyusya kubufwe bo ghakilapo amasiku matatu nu kumulangisya pabwelu, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />teko ku bandu bosi, loli abakamboni bene bo u Chala akabasala nganila ngati utwe, twe tukalya nu kung’wa poka nawe bo asyuka ku bufwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Po akatulaghila ukuti tulumbilile ku bandu, nu kubasimikisya ukuti weyuyo u Chala amusalite kuba mulongi wa bo bali nubumi sona nabafwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Weyuyo bosi abasololi bakasimikisya ukuti wesi yo akusubila mumwake, akwisa pakupokela uluhobokelo lwa mbibi syake, ukwendela mwilita lyake.<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abapanja bakupokela u Mbepo Mwikemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Bo u Pitala akali akuyugha sisi, u Mbepo Mwikemo akawa pa bosi bo bakifwa amasyu ghake. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Po abitiki bo bakasilimuliwako, bo bakisa nu Pitala bakaswigha, ukuti ichabupi cha Mbepo Mwikemo chakusiwa pa bapanja. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Pakuti bakabifwa bakuyughila mundimi isingi nukumupala u Chala. Po u Pitala akamula akati, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Imba alipo umundu yumo yo abaghile pakukanisya amisi ukuti abandu aba batakosiwe, bope bakapokela u Mbepo Mwikemo ngati twetwe?”<verse eid="ACT 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Po akabalamula ukuti bosiwe mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu. Po bakamusuma ukuti ikale nabo amasiku amapala bubu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">U Pitala akuchilingannya ichipanga syo sikabombiwa mu Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Abatumiwa poka nabakamu aba mu Yudeya bakakifwa ukuti abapanja bope bakapokela amasyu agha Chala. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Bo u Pitala abuka ku Yelusalemu, po bo bakasilimuliwa bakamususya, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />bakati, “Ukingila mu nyumba ya bandu bo batasimuliwe nu kulya nabo poka.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Po u Pitala akabalingannya fyosi fyo fikabombiwa ukwandila ko kubwandilo, akati, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Une ngaba mu kaya aka Yopa ngiputagha, ngatesya ichiseteka, ngatesya ichindu chimo cho chikaboneka ngati cho chimwenda ichikulu, cho chikakoliwa mumbali syosi folo chikwika kumwanya nukwisa pa une. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ngaketelesya ngani mukati nu kutesya ifinyamana ifya finama folo ifya muchisu, nifya mungolongo, fyo fikwendela ifukwe, sona nifiyuni fya mumwanya. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Po ngifwa isyu likuyugha likuti, Pitala nyamuka! Ghogha ulye.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Loli ngamula ngati, ‘Awe, Malafyale, pakuti ifindu fyo fili mwiko sona fyo finyalite fitingile lumo mu mulomo wangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Isyu likifwika sona ilya bubili ukufuma kumwanya, likati, ‘Fyo u Chala pala afiswepesya, utakati finyalite.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Sisisi sikabombiwa katatu, po fyosi fikanyamuliwa sona ukubuka kumwanya. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Po pakabalilo kala kala abandu batatu bakafika pa nyumba yo tukabamo, bakatumiwa ku une ukufuma mu Kesaliya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Po u Mbepo akambusya une akati, ‘Mbuke nabo ukusita kukayikila. Abawamwitu aba sikisi tukabuka nabo poka nu kwingila mu nyumba ya mundu yula. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Po akatubusya mo akatesekesya u wandumi imilile mu nyumba yake nu kumubusya ukuti, ‘Tuma umundu ku Yopa ukuti amwitisye u Simoni yo bakuti Pitala, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />akwisa pakubabusya amasyu gho ghakwisa pakupoka uwe na ba munyumba yako bosi.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Bo nanda pakuyugha, u Mbepo Mwikemo akika papabo ngati twetwe ku bwandilo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Imbo1.5</ref>.</char></note>Po ngakumbuka syo u Malafyale akayugha ukuti, ‘U Yohani akosya na misi, loli umwe mukwisa pakosiwa nu Mbepo Mwikemo. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Po pala u Chala akabapa abanja ichabupe ngati cho akatupa utwe, tukasubila u Malafyale u Yesu Kilisitu, Po une ngaba ne wenu ukuti mukanile u Chala?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Bo bifwa sisisi, bakaleka pakususya, bakamupala u Chala bakati, “Po u Chala abapile abapanja ulusako lwa kupindukila ku bumi.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichipanga cha mu Andiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Imbo8.1-4</ref>.</char>
    </note>Abitiki bo bakanyambana chifukwa cha kufwimiwa ko kukaba kwa Sitefani, bakenda mupaka bakafika ku Fonika, mu Sayipulasi, na mu Andiyokiya, ukusita kumubusya yumo isyu, loli ku ba Yuda bene. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Loli abitiki, bo bakafuma ku Sayipulasi na ku Kileni, bakabuka ku Andiyokiya nukuyugha na ba Giliki, sona na pakulumbilila Amasyu Amisa agha Malafyale u Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Po amaka gha Malafyale ghakaba nabo, sona abingi bakusubila nukupindukila kwa Malafyale.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Akapango kaka, kakifwika mumakutu gha chipanga cha mu Yelusalemu, sona bakamutuma u Balanabasi ku Andiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Bo afika nu kutesya ichisa cha Chala, akahoboka nu kubakasya bosi ukuti bamukakamile u Malafyale nu moyo wabo ghosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />U Balanabasi akaba mundu mwisa, yo akisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo nu lwitiko, sona abandu abingi bakapindukila kwa Malafyale.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Po u Balanabasi akabuka ku Talisa pakumulonda u Sabuli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Bo amwagha akabuka nawe ku Andiyokiya, pakuti ichinja chosi bakaba poka mu chipanga nu kumanyisya ichilundilo cha bandu, po mu Andiyokiya momo abamanyili bakandila pakwitisiwa ukuti ba Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Akabalilo kala kala, bamo abasololi bakika ukufuma ku Yelusalemu nukubuka ku Andiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Imbo21.10</ref>.</char></note>Po yumo mumwabo, yo akaba we Agabasi, akasolola mwa Mbepo ukuti kuyukuba isala ingulu pa chisu cha pasi chosi, po isala iyi yikisa pakabalilo ka kalabudiyasi. (Kaba kabalilo bo Kalabudiyasi we malafyale.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Po Abamanyili bakifwana ukuti wesi atume chosi cho angaba nacho ukubatula abakamu bo bakwikala mu Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Bakabomba isi, pakubatumila ifyabupi abasongo ba muchipanga ukwendela mwa Balanabasi nu Sabuli.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ukufwimiwa kukongelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Akabalilo kala kala u malafyale u Helodi akanda pakubafwima bamo aba mu chipanga. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Akamughogha u Yakobo uwamwabo wa Yohani nu panga. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Bo atesya ukuti cha bahobosya ngani aba Yuda, akabukilila pakumukola u Pitala. (Isi sikaboneka pakabalilo ka lusekelo lwa chibama ichisita chilungo.) <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ukf12.1-27</ref>.</char></note>Bo amukola, akamwighalila mujela, mo akamubika munyobe sya tubukutila folo utwa abalindili ukuti bamulindililaghe. U Helodi akalonda ukumufumya nukubuka nawe ku bandu bo ulusekelo lwa Pasaka lwamala. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Po u Pitala akasungiwa mujela, loli ichipanga chikamwiputilagha ngani kwa Chala.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pitala akusatuliwa mujela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Bo u Helodi akuya pakumufumya, ubusiku bo u Pitala akaghona utulo pakati pa balindilili babili bala, akapinyiwa ni mbingu sibili, sona pamulyango pakaba abalindili bo bakalindililagha ijela. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Umwakukenusya bubu uwandumi wa Malafyale akamubonekela, ubwelu bukabala mujela mula. Akamukoma u Pitala mumbafu, akamunyamusya nukuyugha ukuti, “Nyamuka lubilo!” Po imbingu sikawa ukufuma munyobe syake. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Po uwandumi akati, ‘Ipinya ulamba mu musana wako nu kufwala isapato syako. U Pitala akabomba bububu. Po uwandumi akayugha akati, “Fwala umuselekesya wako ungonge. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Po u Pitala akafuma kusi nukumukonga. Umwene atakasyaghannya ukuti sya bwanaloli syo syabombiwa nu wandumi, loli akinong’ona ukuti achitesya ichisetuka. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bo bapululila pabalindili babwandilo na babubili, bakafika pamulyango wa chela uwakwingilila mukaya kala. Umwakukenusya bubu uwandumi yula akamuleka u Pitala.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Po u Pitala akasyaghannya ukuti, “Ipano namanya ubwanaloli ukuti u Malafyale akatuma uwandumi wake ukuti amboke munyobe sya Helodi na mufyosi fyo aba Yuda bakinong’onagha.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Bo asyaghannya sisisi, akabuka ku nyumba ya Maliya, ung’ina wa Yohani yo ilita ilingi bakati Maliko, ko abandu abingi bakabungana poka sona bakiputagha. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Bo akukong’osya pa mulyango wa lupaso, uwambombo umulindu yo akaba we Loda akisa pakumwamula. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Bo alyaghannya isyu lya Pitala, chifukwa cha lusekelo atakighula ichighi, loli akakindila mukati nukubabusya abanine ukuti u Pitala imilile pamulyango. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bakamwamula bakati, “Upenite uwe!” Loli akalimbikila pakuyugha ukuti sya momumo. Po bakamula bakati, “Wandumi wake!”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Loli u Pitala akendelela pakukong’osya, po bo bamwighulila ichighi, bakamutesya nu kuswigha ngani. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Loli akabatebesya ichongo ninyobe, akabalingannya mo u Malafyale amufumikisya mujela. Po akayugha akati, “Mu mubusye u Yakobo na banyitu sisisi. Po akafuma nu kubuka ku buyo ubungi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Bo kwacha, kukaba ichongo ichikulu pakati pa balindilili, nukulalusannya ukuti, ‘Imba choni cho chabombiwa nu Pitala.?” <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Bo u Helodi akumulonda, loli atakamwagha. Po abalindilili bakalalusiwa nukulamuliwa ukuti baghoghiwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Po u Helodi akafumamo mu Yudeya nukubuka mu Kesaliya pakwikala kula kula.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufwa kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />U Helodi akakalala ngani na bandu ba mu Tili nu Sidoni. Po bakisa kukwake nu moyo ghoka, bakamunnyengelela u Bulasita u songo wa nyumba ya bunyafyale ukuti abafwe. Po bakasuma umutende chifukwa ichakulya chabo chikafumagha muchisu cha malafyale yula yula.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Pisiku lyo likasaliwa u Helodi akafwala amalaya ghake agha bunyafyale, akikala pa chitengo cha bunyafyale nu kubalingannya abandu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Po abandu bakakolela ngani ukuti, “Ili lyo lisyu lya chala, te mundu hagha.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Papapo na papapo uwandumi wa Malafyale akamukoma u Helodi, chifukwa atakamughindika u Chala, po isomi sikamulya nu kufwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Loli isyu lya Chala likendelelagha pakusata nu kukula.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Po u Balanabasi nu Sabuli bo bamala imbombo yabo, bakanyokela ukufuma ku Yelusalemu, bakamusenya u Yohani yo ilita limo akaba we Maliko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">U Balanabasi nu Sabuli bakusaliwa nu kutumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Muchipanga cha mukaya ka Andiyokiya mukaba abasololi na bamanyisi, u Balanabasi nu Simiyoni yo bakati mufitu, u Lusiyasi uwa mu Keleni, u Manayi yo akakulilagha poka nu malafyale u Helodi, nu Sabuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Bo bali pakwiputa kwa Malafyale nukutusya pakulya, u Mbepo Mwikemo akababusya akati, “Musabulile u Balanabasi nu Sabuli ukuti babombe imbombo yo ngabitisya.<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Po bo batusya pakulya nukwiputa, bakabika inyobe pa pabo nukubatuma.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muchisu cha Sayipulasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Bo batumiwa nu Mbepo Mwikemo u Balanabasi nu Sabuli bakabuka mukaya ka Selebukiya nukuloboka nu bwato pakubuka pa kasungo ka Sayipulasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Bo bafika mu Salami, bakalumbilila amasyu gha Chala mu nyumba sya kwiputilamo isya ba Yuda. Bakaba poka nu Yohani uwa kubafwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bo babukilila mosi mu kasungo bakafikila ku Pafosi, bakamwagha umundu uwa mayele, umu Yuda umusololi wabumyasi, ilita lyake akaba we Bala Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />yo akaba nu Saligiya Pabuli, yo akaba mundu wa mahala, weyo akamwitisya u Balanabasi nu Sabuli ukuti bateghelesye Isyu lya Chala. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Loli Elimasi uwa mayele (pakuti ilita lyake likang’anamula bububu) akabasusya nu kughesya pakumunyosya umulaghili wa chisu ukuti atakasubile. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Po u Sabuli yo bakati Pabuli, akisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo, akamulolelesya uwa mayele yula <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />nukuti, “We mwana wa Satana! We mulughu wa chindu chosi cho chisa, sona wiswile nu bumyasi nu kusimbula, imba utakuleka pakunyongannya isila inyisa isya Malafyale? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Pololi, tesya inyobe ya Malafyale yili pa uwe, po ukwisa pakuba mufwa maso nukupotwa pa kutesya isuba pakabalilo akapala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Papapo na papapo ukabefu ni chisi fikamuwila, akapulumbagha pakulonda yumo uwa kuti amukole inyobe. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Bo umulindili wa chisu atesya syo sikabombiwagha akasubila, pakuti akaswigha ni chimanyisyo cha Malafyale.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu kaya aka Andiyokiya mu Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Po u Pabuli na banine bakenda pa bwato ukufuma mu Pafosi nukubuka ku Peliga mu chisu cha Pamufiliya, ko u Yohani akabaleka nu kunyokela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Loli bakenda ukufuma ku Peliga ukufika ku Andiyokiya uwa mu Pisidiya. Po bakingila mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo pisiku lya kutusya nu kwikala pasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bo babelenga mumabuku gha Ndaghilo sya Mozesi nagha basololi, abalongosi ba nyumba yakwiputilamo bakabatumila amasyu aghakuti, “Bakamu, pala muli na masyu aghakubabusya abandu aba, yugha.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Po u Pabuli akimilila, akabatebesya ichongo ni nyobe yake akati, “Banalume ba mu Izilayeli, namwe mukumoghopa u Chala, teghelesya. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Ukf1.7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Ukf12.51</ref>.</char></note>U Chala uwa bandu aba mu Izilayeli abanyenya bitu, akabakwesya abandu bala bo bagheni mu chisu cha Ijiputi, po akabatisya mu chisu cha Ijiputi namaka ghake ghosi, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:34">Ukb4.34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Ukk1.31</ref>. </char></note>pakuti akayimba nabo ifinja fote mungolongo. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Ukk7.1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Yos14.1</ref>.</char></note>Akakomannya ifikolo fya bandu seveni mu Kenani, nukubapa ichisu chabo ukuti bapyane pakuba chabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Abl2.16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam3.20</ref>.</char></note>Fyosi fififi fikasenya ifinja folo handeledi fifite. Panyuma pasisi akabapa abalongi ukufika pakabalilo ka musololi u Samuyeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam8.5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10.21</ref>.</char></note> Po abandu bakasuma u malafyale, u Chala akabapa u Sabuli umwana wa Kishi, umundu waluko lwa Benjamini, pa finja fote. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Sam13.14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Mas89.20</ref>.</char></note>Bo amutisyapo u Sabuli, akabasalila u Devedi ukuti abe we malafyale wabo, yo akasimikisya ukuti, ‘Namwagha u Devedi umwana wa Yese, umundu wa pamoyo wangu, yo ayukubomba ubwighane bwangu bosi.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Akaba we Yesu, uwaluko lwa Devedi, yo u Chala akamubika pakuba Mupoki wa Izilayeli ukuyana nipangano lyake. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Miko1.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk3.3</ref>.</char></note> Bo akali atisile umwene, u Yohani akalumbilila ulosyo lwa lupinduko ku bandu bosi aba mu Izilayeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoh1.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Miko1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Yoh1.27</ref>.</char></note>Bo u Yohani ali papipi pakumalisya imbombo yake, akabalalusya abandu bala akati, ‘Imba mukwinong’ona ukuti une ne wenu? Une tenene yo mukumulindila. Loli tesya, umwene akwisa panyuma pa pangu. Ndabaghile napo papala pakusatula utukungilo twa sapato syake.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Mwee bakamu bangu ba Izilayeli, abaluko lwa Abulahamu namwe mukumoghopa u Chala, isyu lya bupoki lya tumiwa ku utwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Pakuti bo bakwikala mu Yelusalemu na balongosi babo, bo batakamumanya u Yesu, pamo amasyu gha basololi gho bakabelengagha isiku lyosi ilya kutusya, bakakwanilisya syosi sisisi pakumughogha. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat27.22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">23</ref>.</char></note>Napo batakamwagha ni nongwa nayimo iyakumughoghela, loli bakamusuma u Pilati ukuti u Yesu aghoghiwe.<verse eid="ACT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:52-56">Luk23.52-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:8-42">Yoh19.8-42</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo bamala syosi syo amasimbo ghakayugha nisya yuyo, bakamwisya pambinjika nukumubika mwipumba. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Loli u Chala akamususya kubufwe, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Imbo1.3</ref>.</char></note>po amasiku amingi akababonekela bo bakenda nawe ukufuma mu Galileya ukubuka mu Yelusalemu, bo ipano bo bakamboni bake ku bandu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Po tuli pakubabusya Amasyu Amisa gho u Chala akapangana na banyenya bitu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mas2.7</ref>.</char></note>ukuti akwanilisya ku twe bana bake pakumususya u Yesu kubufwe ukuyana namo mukasimbiliwa mwa masalimo uwabubili ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“Uwe we Mwana wangu, ipano na kupapa.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Yis55.3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Loli pakuti akamususya kubufwe, ukuti atakanyokele sona pakubola. Ngati mo u Chala akayughila ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ngwisa pakubapa ulusayo ulwikemo ulwa bwanaloli, lo akapangana nu Devedi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mas16.10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pololi akayugha sona mwa Masalimo uyungi ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Utakitikisye ukuti u Mwikemo wako atesye ukubola.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Pakuti bo u Devedi abomba ukuyana namo u Chala akabatikila pakabalilo kake, akafwa nukusiliwa poka na banyenya bake, po umufimba wake ghukabola, <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />loli yo u Chala akamususya kubufwe atakatesyapo ukobola. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Pololi bakamu bangu, musimanye ukuti mwa Yesu, momo mukufumusiwa ukuhobokeliwa kwa mbibi, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />ukwendela mumwake wesi yo akusubila akubwagha ubupoki bo wesi angayughiwa pakuba mwisa pakukonga indaghilo sya Moses. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Muchebe ukuti syo abasololi bakayugha sitakabombiwe ku umwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb1.5</ref>.</char></note>‘Tesya, mwe balobesyo umwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Muswighe nu kufwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Pakuti ngubomba imbombo une mumasiku ghinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">imbombo yo temukasubile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">napo pala yumo akubabusya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Bo u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakafumamo munyumba yakwiputilamo, abamanyili bakabasuma ukuti bise bababusye sona amasyu ghagha pisiku lya kutusya ilingi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Bo abandu bafumapo palukomano lula, aba Yuda abingi na bakupindukila ku Chiyuda, bakamukonga u Pabuli nu Balanabasi, bakababusya nu kubakasya ukuti bendelele pakwikala ukuyana nichisa cha Chala.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Po pisiku lyakutusya ilingi, bakabungana bosi poka ngati kaya kosi pakwifwa isyu lya Chala. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Loli bo aba Yuda batesya ichilundilo cha bandu, bakisula nakabini, bakasusannya nasyo u Pabuli akayugha nu kumusamula ngani. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Po u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakayugha nubukifu ukuti, “Chikaba chakulondiwa ukuti Isyu lya Chala liyughiwe tasi ku umwe. Loli pakuti mwaghakana, sona ukuti mukwinong’ona mutabaghile pakupokela ubumi bwa bwile na bwile, tesya, tukunyokela ku bapanja. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Yis42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Malafyale akatupa ilamulo lyakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Nakubika uwe pakuba bwelu ku bapanja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ukuti abandu ba muchisu chosi bapokiwe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Bo abapanja bifwa sisisi, bakahoboka nu kupala Isyu lya Chala, po bosi bo bakabikiwa ku bumi bwa bwile na bwile bakasubila.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Isyu lya Malafyale likasata muchisu chosi. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Loli aba Yuda bakabakakamisya abakolo abamanyikwe aba kwiputa u Chala, na basongo aba mukaya, bakanda pakubafwima u Pabuli nu Balanabasi nukubatisyamo mukaya kabo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat10.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1">Miko6.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk9.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10.11</ref>.</char></note>Loli abene bakabakung’undila ulufumbi ulwa mufinama fyabo, bakabuka mukaya ka Ikoniyamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Po abitiki aba mukaya aka Andiyokiya bakahoboka ngani nu kwisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Nisya mu Ikoniyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Bo bali mu Ikoniyamu u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakingila mu nyumba yakwiputilamo iya ba Yuda, bakayugha na maka ngani, po ichilundilo ichikulu icha ba Yuda na ba Giliki chikasubila. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Loli aba Yuda bo batakasubila, bakasongelesya abapanja nukubananga inyinong’ono syabo ukuti bababenge abitiki. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Po u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakikala kula kula akabalilo akatali, pakuyugha nu bukifu ngani isya Malafyale, yo akasimikisya nisya chisa chake pakubapa amaka aghakubombela ifimanyilo ni fiswigho. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Loli abandu ba mukaya akakulu bakapaghulana, bamo bakaba kumbali ya ba Yuda, abanine kumbali ya batumiwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Po abapanja na ba Yuda poka na balongosi bakabatika ukuti babayifye abatumiwa nukubanyuka na mabwe, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />bo abatumiwa bifwa isi, bakakindila mukaya akakulu aka Lisitila na ka Delibe mukaya ka Likaboniya, sona namutwaya utwakusyungulila. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Kula kula bakalumbilila Amasyu Amisa.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaya aka Lisitila na ka Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mu Lisitila mukabamo umundu yo akafwa ifinama, sona atakendapo lumo ukufuma mo akapapiliwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Akamwifwa bo u Pabuli akuyugha. Po u Pabuli akumulolelesya sona nukutesya ukuti akaba nu lwitiko ulwakuti angapola, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />akayugha nisyu lya pamwanya akati, “Imilila, gholosya ifinama fyako!” Umundu yula akanyela nukwanda pakwenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Bo ichilundilo cha tesya syo u Pabuli akabomba, bakanda pakukuta munjugha iya Likaboniya ukuti, “Aba chala batwikila utwe ngati po bandu.”<verse eid="ACT 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bakamwita u Balanabasi ukuti abe we Zebusi, sona u Pabuli bakamwita ukuti we Helemesi, chifukwa weyo akatangila pakuyugha. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Po umuputi wa Zebusi, yo inyumba ya chala wake yikaba kusi kukaya akakulu ngani, akisa nu kambako na maluba pamulyango wa lupaso pakuti umwene ni chilundilo bakalondagha pakubika ifyabupi ku batumiwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Loli bo u Balanabasi nu Pabuli bifwa sisisi, bakanyepulannya amalaya ghabo nukukindila pakati pa chilundilo, bakakuta bakati, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Ukf20.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Mas146.6</ref>.</char></note>“Mwe bandu mwee, choni cho mukubomba sisisi? Utwe twe bandu bubu ngati mwemwe, tuli pano pakulumbilila Amasyu Amisa, ukuti mufileke ifindu ifibibi nukumukonga u Chala umumi yo akapela kumwanya nichisu chapasi, ni nyanja nafyosi fyo filimo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Mungulilo iyakale, akafileka ifikolo fyosi ukuti fyende musila syabo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Loli atakalekapo pakusimikisya, pakuti akabomba ifisa, akabapa ifula ukufuma ku mwanya ni nyinulo pakabalilo kake akisa, akubapa ichakulya nukwisusya imyoyo yinyu nu kubuhoboke.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Pakuyugha amasyu ghaghagha, bakatamiwa ngani pakukanisya ifilundilo ukuti batakabikaghe ifyabupi ku kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Po bakafika kula kula aba Yuda ukufuma ku Andiyokiya na ku Ikoniya, bakabannyengelela abandu, po bakamunyuka u Pabuli namabwe, nukumughusila kusi kwa kaya akakulu, bakinong’ona ukuti afwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Loli bo abamanyili bamubunganila, akanyamuka nukunyokela mukaya mula. Isiku ilingi, akabuka nu Balanabasi ku Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakunyokela ku Andiyokiya mu chisu cha Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Bo balumbilila Amasyu Amisa mukaya mula, nukukaba abamanyili abingi, bakanyokela mu Lisitila na ku Ikoniyamu na ku Andiyokiya, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />bakabakasya imyoyo ya bamanyili, bakabalimbikisya ukuti bendelele pakuba mu lwitiko, nukuti tubaghile ukwenda mundamyo inyingi ukuti twingile mu Bunyafyale bwa Chala. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bo basala abasongo mu chipanga chosi, nu kwiputa poka na pakutusya pakulya, bakababika kwa Malafyale yo bakamusubila.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Po bakati bapulusannya muchigaba cha Pidisiya, bakisa ku Pamufiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Po bakati balumbilila Amasyu mu Peliga, bakabuka ku Ataliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />ukufuma kula kula bakingila mubwato nukunyokela ku Andiyokiya, kula kula bakababika mu chisa cha Chala pa mbombo yo bakamalisya.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Bo bafika mu Andiyokiya, bakachibungannya ichipanga poka nukuchibusya fyosi fyo u Chala akababombela, sona namo akighulila isila ya bapanja ukuti basubile. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Po bakikala kula kula akabalilo akatali ngani na bitiki.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Ulukomano mu Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev12.3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Abandu bamo bakisa ukufuma ku Yudeya, bakabamanyisya abakamu ukuti, “Ukusita ukuti mutasilimuliwe ukuyana nu muteto wa Mozesi, mu tabaghile pakupokiwa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Po u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakasusannya nabo ngani nisya fundo yiyiyi, po u Pabuli nu Balanabasi poka nabakamu bamo bakasaliwa ukubuka ku Yelusalemu ku batumiwa na ku basongo ukuti bayughisannye nisya lilalusyo lilili.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Po bakatumiwa ni chipanga, bakenda bapulusannya mu Fonike, na mu Samaliya, bakabalingannya nisya kapindukile ka bapanja, sisisi sikabapa ukuhoboka ukukulu bosi abitiki. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Bo bafika mu Yelusalemu, bakapokeliwa ni chipanga, na batumiwa, na basongo, nukubabusya syosi syo u Chala akabomba nabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Loli abitiki bamo bo bakaba mukabukutila ka ba Falisayi bakimilila nukuti, “Sibaghile ukuti abapanja bope basilimuliwe, nukubabusya ukuti basunge indaghilo sya Mozesi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Abatumiwa na basongo bakabungana poka ukuti batesye inongwa yiyiyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:43">Imbo10.43</ref>.</char></note>Bo basusannya akabalilo akatali, u Pitala akimilila nukubabusya ukuti, “Mwee bakamu bangu, musimenye ukuti kale u Chala akasala mumwinyu, ukuti mu mulomo mwangu abapanja bifwe Amasyu Amisa nukusubila. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Po u Chala weyo aghumenye umoyo, akasimikisya kukwabo pakubapa u Mbepo Mwikemo ukuyana namo akatupela nutwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Po atakatulekannyapo utwe nabo, loli akaswepesya imyoyo yabo nulwitiko. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ipano choni cho mukumughela u Chala pakubabika ujoko musingo mwa bamanyili, yo abatata pamo utwe tukapotwa pakunyamula? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Loli tukusubila ukuti tukupokiwa muchisa cha Malafyale u Yesu ngati bope mo bayukupokeliwa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Po ichilundilo chosi chikaba myee, nu kuteghelesya kwa Balanabasi nu Pabuli bo bakubabusya nisya fimanyilo nifiswigho fyo u Chala akabomba na bapanja ukwendela mumwabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Bo bamala pakuyugha, u Yakobo akamula akati, “Mwee bakamu bangu, teghelesya ku une. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />U Simoni alingannya namo u Chala akandila pakubatesya abapanja, ukuti asenyemo mu mwabo abandu aba lita lyake. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Po na masyu gha basololi ghakwitikana na isi, ngati mo kukasimbiliwa ukuti, <verse eid="ACT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amo9.11</ref>.</char></note>Panyuma pa isi ngwisa pakunyokela sona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">nukusenga sona inyumba ya Devedi, yo yikawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ngwisa pakusenga sona ichisami chake</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">nukuchiyannya pakuba sona chamaka ngani,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />ukuti abandu bo bakusyala bamulonde u Malafyale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">na bapanja bosi bo bakwitikisiwa nilita lyangu, <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />ayugha u Malafyale, yo afumbula ifindu fyosi fififi ukufuma kale.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Pololi ukulamula kwangu kwakuti, tutakabatamye abapanja bo bapindukila kwa Chala, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Ukf34.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Lev18.6-23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">17.10-16</ref>.</char></note>loli tubasimbile ku babo, ukuti batakalye ifyakulya fyo finyalite pakuti fyabikiwa ku fifwani, nu bwamalaya, nukuti batakalye ifinyama fyo fyanyongiwa bubu, pamo ibanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Pakuti indaghilo sya Mozesi sikalumbiliwa mutwaya tosi ukwandila mungulilo iyakale yosi, po bakubelenga isiku lyosi ilyakutusya.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukalata akutumiwa ku bitiki bapanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Po abatumiwa na basongo bachipanga bosi, bakinong’ona pakusala abandu bamo mukabukutila kabo nukubatuma ku Andiyokiya poka nu Pabuli nu Balanabasi. Bakamusala u Yudasi yo bakati Balasabasi, nu Sila bo bakaba balongosi mu bitiki, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />po bakabatuma nu kalata uyu, “Utwe twe batumiwa, na basongo, na bawamwinyu, ku bakamu aba mubapanja abitiki ba mu Andiyokiya, Siliya na mu Kilikiya, tukubalamuka. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Twifwa ukuti bamo mukabukutila kitu bakubatamya namasyu, nukufulungannya imyoyo yinyu, napo utwe tutakabalaghilapo. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Po twebosi tukitikana pa kusala bamo abanalume nu kubatuma kukwinyu poka na baghaniwa bitu u Balanabasi nu Pabuli, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />abandu bo bakabutagha ubumi bwabo chifukwa cha lita lya Malafyale u Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Po tukubatumila u Yudasi nu Sila, bo bakwisa pakubabusya ifindu fififi na masyu gha mu mulomo gho tukusimba. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Pakuti chikaboneka chisa kwa Mbepo Mwikemo nutwe, ukuti tutakabanyamulisye ukatundu umukulu ukukila payo akulondiwa ukuti, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />mutakalye ifyakulya fyo fya bikiwa kufifwani, ni banda, na kufinyamana fyo fyanyongiwa bubu, sona nubwamalaya. Mukwisa pakubomba akisa pala mukwepuka ku findu fififi. Musyale akisa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Bo batumiwa, bakabuka ku Andiyokiya, ko bakachibungannya ichipanga poka nu kubapa ukalata yula. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Bo abandu babelenga ukalata yula, bakahoboka chifukwa cha masyu agha lukasyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />U Yudasi nu Sila, bo bakaba basololi, bakayugha nabo amasyu amingi agha lukasyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Bo bighonesyako amasiku ghamo, abandu bala bakabanyosya mu mutende ku bandu bo bakabatuma.<verse eid="ACT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Loli u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakendelela pakwikala mu Andiyokiya, ukumanyisya nu kulumbilila amasyu gha Malafyale poka na banine abangi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakulekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Bo ghakilapo amasiku ghamo, u Pabuli akamubusya u Balanabasi ukuti, “Sakuno, tunyokele nukubendela abakamu bitu mukaya kosi akakulu ko tukalumbililamo amasyu gha Malafyale, sona tuye tubatesye mo bakwikalila.”<verse eid="ACT 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />U Balanabasi akalondagha u Yohani yo bakati Maliko ukuti babuke nawe. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Imbo13.13</ref>.</char></note>Loli u Pabuli akinong’ona ukuti chitangaba chisa pakumusenya yo akabaleka mu Pamufiliya, sona atakendelela pakubomba nabo imbombo yabo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Po bakadalingana ngani mupaka nukulekana, u Balanabasi nu Maliko bakakwela mubwato nukubuka ku Sayipulasi. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Loli u Pabuli akasala u Sila, akabuka nawe, bo abitiki abanine bababika muchisa cha Malafyale. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Po akapulusannya mu Siliya na mu Silisiya pakufikasya ifipanga.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">U Timoti akubuka poka nu Pabuli nu Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Po u Pabuli akafika ku Delibe nu Lisitila, ko kukaba umumanyili yo bakati Timoti, yo umayi wake akaba mu Yuda sona akaba mwitiki, loli uwise wake akaba mu Giliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Abitiki bosi aba mu Lisitila na mu Ikoniyamu bakamuyugha u Timoti ubwisa. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />U Pabuli akalondagha ukuti u Timoti abuke nawe pabulendo bwake, po akamusilimula, chifukwa cha ba Yuda bo bakwikala mubuyo bula, pakuti bosi bakamanya ukuti uwise mu Giliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Bo bakupulusannya mutwaya, bakabapa abitiki indaghilo syo sikapangiwa na batumiwa na basongo aba mu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Po ifipanga fikaba na maka mulwitiko, po fikongelelapo pakubala amasiku ghosi.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichisetuka cha Pabuli mu Tulowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />U Pabuli na bamanyani bake pakapulusannya mu Filigiya na mu Galatiya u Mbepo Mwikemo atakabitikisya ukuti balumbilile amasyu mu Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Bo bafika pambaka ya Misiya, bakaghesya pakubuka ku Bitiniya, loli u Mbepo uwa Yesu atakabitikisya. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Po bakapulusannya mu Misiya, nukubuka ku Tulowasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Po ichisetuka chikamubonekela u Pabuli pabusiku. Pakaba umundu uwa ku Makedoniya imilile akamusuma ukuti, “Wise kuno ku Makedoniya ukuti utwafwe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Bo u Pabuli atesya bububu ichisetuka chila, papapo na papapo tukiyannya pakubuka ku Makedoniya pakuti tukinong’ona ukuti u Chala atwitisya ukuti tulumbilile Amasyu Amisa ku kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Filipu, ukupinduka kwa Lidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tukanyamuka mu bwato ukubuka mu Tulowasi, tukagholoka nukubuka ku Samotilaki, po ilya ningelo lyake tukafika mu Niyapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ukufuma kula kula tukabuka ku Filipu, akaya akakulu ngani aka mu Makedoniya, na mutwaya utwa chiloma, po tukikala kula kula amasiku amingi ngani. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Pisiku ilyakutusya tukafumamo mukaya kala nukubuka kumbali ya kulusoko, ko tukinong’ona ukuti kukabako ubuyo ubwakwiputilako, po tukikala pasi nukuyugha na bakolo bo bakabungana kula kula. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Po akatwifwa umukolo yumo yo ilita lyake akaba we Lidiya uwa mukaya ka Tiyatila, akaghulisyagha amalaya amakesamile, yo akamwiputa u Chala. U Malafyale akamwighula umoyo wake ukuti ateghelesye syo u Pabuli akuyugha. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Bo umwene osiwa na ba munyumba yake, akatwitisya utwe akati, pala naloli mwandesya ukuti ne mwitiki wa Malafyale, sakuno mwikale mu nyumba yangu.” Po akatunnyengelela utwe ukuti tubuke.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli nu Sila bighaliliwa mujela mukaya ka Filipu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Isiku limo bo tukubuka kubuyo ubwakwiputilako, tukakomana nu mulindu umusya yo akaba ni mbepo imbibi, yo yikamupelelagha ukuti ayughe ifya mundasi. Akamukabilagha umalafyale wake indalama inyingi ngani nu bulaghusi bwake. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Akamukonga u Pabuli nutwe, akakuta akati, “Abandu aba bambombo ba Chala uwa kumwanya ngani, bo bakuyugha isila ya bupoki.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Po akabomba sisisi amasiku amingi. Loli u Pabuli akakalala ngani, umwakuti akaghalabuka nukuyibusya imbepo imbibi ukuti, “Ngukulamula mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu ukuti fumamo mumwake.” Po yikafumamo akabalilo kala kala.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Loli bo abenecho batesya ukuti ko bakasubilagha pakukabilamo kafumitemo, bakamukola u Pabuli nu Sila, bakabaghusila ku munalo ukuti bakomane na balaghili. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bo bisa nabo pamaso gha balongi bakati, “Abandu aba ba Yuda sona bakufulungannya akaya kitu, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />po bakumanyisya imiteto yo yili mwiko ku utwe twe Baloma, ukusitika pamo ukusibomba.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Po ichilundilo chikingililapo ukumukola u Pabuli nu Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Po abalongi bakanyepulannya amalaya gha Pabuli nu Sila, nukubalamula ukuti basyembiwe nifikoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Bo basyembiwa ngani, bakabighalila mujela, po bakamulamula umulindilili wa jela ukuti abasunge akisa. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Bo apokela ululaghilo lululu, umulindilili yula akabingisya muchipinda icha mukati ngani, nukubapinyilila ifinama fyabo mu fipimbili.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Loli pakati pabusiku u Pabuli nu Sila bakiputagha nukwimba inyimbo sya Chala, po abakayidi abanine bakabateghelesyagha. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Po umwakukenusya bububu kukaba akasenyenda akakulu ngani, umwakuti kakaneng’ennya ulwalo ulwa jela yila. Papapo na papapo ifighi fikighuka, sona syope ni mbingu sya bakayidi bosi sikasatuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Bo umulindilili wa jela anyamuka, akatesya ukuti pamulyango wa jela pighukite, po akaghusa upanga wake ukuti ighoghe mwene, chifukwa akinong’onagha ukuti abakayidi bakindamo. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Loli u Pabuli akakuta ngani akati, “Utakifulasye wemwene, twebosi tuli muno.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Po umulindilili akitisya ukuti bamupe inyale, akakindila mukati, nukuwa mu finama fya Pabuli nu Sila bo akutetema. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Po akabafumya kusi nukubalalusya ukuti, “Mwe basongo, imba mbombe choni ukuti mbokiwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bakamwamula bakati, “Usubile mwa Malafyale u Yesu, po uyukupokiwa uwe naba mu nyumba yako.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Po bakamubusya isyu lya Malafyale poka naba munyumba yake bosi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Pakabalilo kala kala, umulindilili akabasenya nukubasuka ifilonda fyabo. Papapo na papapo akosiwa yuyo poka naba munyumba yake bosi.<verse eid="ACT 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Po akabuka nabo ku nyumba yake nukubapa ichakulya, akahoboka ngani poka naba munyumba yake, chifukwa bakasubila mwa Chala.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bo kwacha, abalongi bakabatuma abasilikali nu lulaghilo lwakuti, “Mubasatule abandu abo babukaghe.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Po umulindilili wa jela yula akamubusya u Pabuli akati, “Abalongi bandumila amasyu ghakuti mbasatule ukuti mubukaghe, po losulu mufume, mubuke mu mutende.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Loli u Pabuli akababusya abasilikali akati, bakatusyembela utwe pachilundilo cha bandu ukusita kutulonga utwe, utwe twe ba Chiloma, bakatutaghila mu jela. Po ipano bakulonda ukuti batufumye kubusyefu? Awe, loli baleke bise batufumye bene.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Abasilikali bakababusya sisisi abalongi, po bakoghopa bo bifwa ukuti bakaba ba Chiloma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Po bakisa nukupepesya ku kwabo, po bakabafumyamo mu jela nu kubasuma ukuti bafumemo mukaya. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Po bakafumamo mu jela nu kubuka mu nyumba ya Lidiya, ko bakakomana na bitiki nu kubakasya nu kufumapo.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Mukaya ka Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Bo u Pabuli nu Sila bakupulusannya mukaya ka Amufipoli na ka Apoloniya, bakafika mukaya ka Tesalonika ko kukaba inyumba ya kwiputilamo iya ba Yuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />U Pabuli akingila mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo ukuyana nu muteto wake, po mumasiku matatu agha kutusya akayughisannya nabo nisya masimbo, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />akabalingannya nu kusimikisya ukuti abaghile u Kilisitu pakutamiwa ngani nu kusyuka kubufwe, sona nukuti, “U Yesu yuyuyu yo ngufumusya ku umwe, yo we Kilisitu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Po bamo bakamunnyengelela nukumukonga u Pabuli nu Sila, na ba Giliki abingi bo bakamwiputa u Chala, na bakolo abingi aba subiliwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Loli aba Yuda bamo bakaba na kabini, sona bakababungannya bamo aba kayilo akabibi muminalo nukupanga akabukutila, po bakandisyagha ifyongo mukaya akakulu, bakakindila ku nyumba ya Yasoni, ukwinong’ona ukuti pamo koko bangamwagha u Pabuli nu Sila ukuti babafumikisye ku chilundilo cha bandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Loli bo bapotwa pakubagha, bakamughusila u Yasoni poka nabitiki bamo pamaso pa balaghili ba mukaya akakulu, bakakolela bakati, “Abandu aba basambulannya ichisu chosi, ipano bisa na mukaya kitu, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />sona u Yasoni abapokela, po bosi bakunangannya indaghilo sya Kayisali, pakuyugha ukuti kuli umalafyale uyungi yo bakuti, we Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Po abandu bosi poka na balongosi bamukaya, bo bifwa sisisi bakakenuka ngani. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Abalaghili bakamulipisya u Yasoni na banine indalama ukuti bakabasatule nukubuka.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli nu Sila mukaya ka Beleya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ubusiku bula bula, abitiki bakamutuma u Pabuli nu Sila ku Beleya, bo bafika bakingila munyumba ya kwiputilamo. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Abene abandu ba mukaya ka Beleya bo bakaba namahala ukukila aba mukaya ka Tesalonika, pakuti bakapokela amasyu nu moyo ghosi, po isiku ni siku bakamanyila mu masimbo ukuti bamanye pala syo u Pabuli akayugha sikaba sya bwanaloli. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Po abingi bakasubila, na bakolo aba Chigiliki abamanyikwe, poka na banalume abingi. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Loli bo aba Yuda aba mukaya ka Tesalonika bifwa ukuti amasyu gha Chala ghalumbiliwa nu Pabuli ku Beleya, bakisa kula kula nukwanda pakusongelesya nukwandisya ifyongo pakati pa chilundilo cha bandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Po papapo napapo abitiki bakamutuma u Pabuli piloboko lya nyanja, loli u Sila nu Timoti bakasyala kula kula. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Po bo bakamusindikila u Pabuli bakabuka nawe mupaka ku Ateni, po u Pabuli akababusya ukuti u Sila nu Timoti bamukonge mwalubilo, po bakafumapo.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akulumbilila mukaya ka Ateni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Bo u Pabuli akubalindilila mukaya ka Ateni, umoyo wake ghukakala ngani bo atesya akaya kosi kiswile ni fifwani. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Po akasusannya na ba Yuda na bakwiputa mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo, nabo akakomanagha nabo muminalo isiku ni siku. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Abamanyisi bamo aba mu Epikuliya nu Sitoyiki bakasusannya nawe. Bamo bakalalusya bakati, “Imba umukonyofu uyu akulonda pakuyugha choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Abanine bakati, “Akuboneka ngati akulumbilila abachala abagheni,” Chifukwa akalumbilila isya Yesu nu kusyuka ku bufwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Po bakamusenya nukubuka nawe po bakabungana pa Eliyopagasi, ko bakamubusya bakati, “Tukulonda utumanyisye ichimanyisyo ichipya cho uli pakufumusya. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Pakuti wisile nifindu ifigheni fyo tukwifwa mumakutu ghitu, po tukulonda ukuti tumanye ukuti ifindu ifi fikung’anamulaki.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Bosi aba mu Ateni na bagheni bo bakikala mula mula akabalilo kosi ukusita kubomba nachimo, loli ukuyugha kwene nu kuteghelesya ifindu ifipya.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Po u Pabuli akimilila pakati pabuyo bwa kubunganapo ubwa Eliyopagasi nukuti, “Mwe bandu bamu Ateni, ngutesya ukuti mufyosi mwe bakwiputa ngani. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:22">Yoh4.22</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti bo ngwenda mukaya nu kutesya mumalo ghinyu agha kwiputilamo, ngachagha nichighemo cho chisimbiwe ukuti, ‘Kwa Chala umusita Kumanyikwa.’ Po weyo mukumwiputa ukusita kumumanya, we yuyo ngubafumukisya umwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Bany8.27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Yis42.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Imbo7.48</ref>.</char></note> U Chala yo akapela ichisu chapasi na fyosi fyo filimo, pakuba we Malafyale wa kumwanya nichisu chapasi, atakwikala mu nyumba sya Chala isya kusengiwa ninyobe sya bandu, <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:8-12">Mas50.8-12</ref>.</char></note>pamo atakubombeliwa ninyobe sya bandu, ngati pala akusobelwa chimo, pakuti umwene weyo akubapa abandu ubumi nu mughi ni fingi fyosi. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ukufuma mufikolo fyosi ifya bandu akapela umundu weka, ukuti bikale pachisu chosi ichapasi, akabikila nganila akabalilo akakwikalila, sona nimbaka sya kwikalila kwabo, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:20">Aba Lom1.20</ref>.</char></note>ukuti bamulondaghe u Chala, pamo ukumulondesya nu kumwagha, napo umwene atakuba kubutali muyumo mwa utwe, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />pakuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Mu mwake, tuli nu bumi, tukwenda, sona tuliko.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Siyanite bubu namo abakwata inyimbo binyu bakati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Pakuti nutwe twe bana bake.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Pakuti nutwe twe bana ba Chala, tutakinong’onaghe ukuti u Chala ayanite ni chifwani icha golide, pamo icha siliva, pamo icha ibwe, cho chikabisiwa akisa na mahala gha bandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Akabalilo ko abandu batakamumanyagha u Chala akabalekelela, loli ipano akulamulila abandu bosi kosi ko bali ukuti bapinduke nukusileka imbibi syabo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Pakuti abikite isiku lyoka lyo akwisa pakulongela ichisu cho bakwikalamo abandu aba bwanaloli ukwendela mu mundu yo amusalite, abasimikisya sisisi abandu bosi pakumususya kubufwe.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Bo bifwa isya kusyuka ku bufwe, bamo bakamobesya, loli abanine bakati, “Tukulonda tukwifwe ukuyugha sona nisya isi.”<verse eid="ACT 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Po u Pabuli akafumapo palukomano lwabo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Loli bamo bakamukonga nu kusubila, uwa mubamo akaba we Diyonisiya uwa mubuyo bwa Eliyopagasi, nu mukolo yumo yo ilita lyake akaba we Damalisi, nabanine bo bakaba nabo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli mukaya ka Kolindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Panyuma pa isi, u Pabuli akafumako ku Ateni nukubuka ku Kolindi. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ko akamwagha umu Yuda yumo yo ilita lyake akaba we Akwila, yo akapapiwa mukaya ka Pondi, akafuma bubu ku Itale poka nu mukasi wake u Pulisila, chifukwa u Kalabudiyasi akalamula ukuti aba Yuda bosi bafumemo mu Loma, po u Pabuli akabuka pa kubatesya, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />akikala nukubomba poka nabo pakuti wepe akaba mupanga fisakasa ukuyana namo bakabombelagha. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Isiku lyosi ilyakutusya akabalingannya mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo, ukughesya pa kubannyengelela aba Yuda naba Giliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Bo u Sila nu Timoti bafika ukufuma ku Makedoniya, u Pabuli akikolesannya ngani nu bulumbilili, akabasimikisya aba Yuda ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Loli bo bakumususya nu kumutuka u Pabuli, akakung’unda imyenda yake nukubabusya ukuti, “Ibanda linyu likale pa mitu yinyu, une nde nacho nachimo, ukwanda ipano ngwisa pakubuka ku bapanja.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Po akafumapo nukubuka ku nyumba ya mundu yumo ilita lyake akaba we Titi Yusito, yo akamwiputagha u Chala, inyumba yake yikapalamana ni nyumba ya kwiputilamo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />U Kilisipa yo akaba mulongosi wa nyumba ya kwiputilamo poka naba mu nyumba yake bosi bakamusubila u Malafyale, sona na bandu abingi aba mu Kolindi bakamwifwa u Pabuli nu kusubila, sona bakosiwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Po u Malafyale akamubusya u Pabuli pabusiku mu chisetuka akati, “Utakoghopaghe, loli endelela pakuyugha sona utakabe myee, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />pakuti une indi nuwe. Nayumo umundu yo akwisa pakulwa nuwe nukufulasya, pakuti indi nabo abandu abingi mukaya muno.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Po u Pabuli akikala kula kula ichinja choka ni myesi sikisi, akubamanyisya amasyu gha Chala mu mwabo.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Bo u Galiyo mulindilili wa chisu cha Akaya, aba Yuda bakabungana poka nu kumukola u Pabuli nukwisa nawe kubuyo ubwakulongelako inongwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Bakayugha bakati, “Umundu uyu akubannyengelela abandu ukuti bamwipute u Chala ukukindana ni ndaghilo situ.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Loli bo u Pabuli akulonda pa kuyugha, u Galiyo akababusya aba Yuda akati, “Pala inongwa yikaba yakuti yumo ananga indaghilo, pamo amunangila yumo, po ngali ndabateghelesya umwe mwe ba Yuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Loli pakuti ukudalingana kwinyu kwa masyu, na malita, ni ndaghilo sinyu, po musitesye mwebene, une ndakulonda pakulonga sisisi!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Po akabakisyapo apa kulongelapo inongwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Po bosi bakamukola u Sositeni, umulongosi wa nyumba ya kwiputilamo, nukumukoma pabuyo bwa kulongelapo inongwa. Loli u Galiyo ata kabikilako umoyo pa sisisi.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akunyokela mukaya ka Andiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:18">Ukk6.18</ref>. </char>
    </note>U Pabuli akendelela ukwikala na bitiki mu Kolindi amasiku amingi, po akabalagha nukukwela mubwato nukubuka ku Siliya poka nu Pulisila nu Akwila. Akamwa ichingw’ili chake mu Kengeleya chifukwa cha kulapa kwake. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Po bakafika mukaya ka Efeso ko u Pabuli akamuleka u Pulisila nu Akwila, loli umwene akingila mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo mo bakayughisannya na Yuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bo bamulalusya ukuti ikale nabo akabalilo akatali, loli umwene atakitika. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Loli bo akubaleka, akababusya akati, “Ngwisa pakunyokela pala u Chala itikisya,” po akakwela mubwato nukufumamo mu Efeso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Bo bafika mukaya ka Kesaliya, akabuka mu Yelusalemu nu kuchilamuka ichipanga, po akabuka mukaya ka Andiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Bo ikalamo akabalilo akatali kula kula, akanyamuka nukupulusannya muchingaba cha Galatiya nicha Filigiya pakubakasya abamanyili bosi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Apolo mukaya ka Efeso na ka Kolindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Po umu Yuda yumo yo ilita lyake akaba we Apolo, yo akapapiwa mukaya ka Alekizandiliya akafika ku Efeso, akaba mundu wamahala mukayughile, sona akaghamanya ngani amasimbo. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Akamanyisiwa akisa nisya sila ya Malafyale, pakuba nu mbepo uwalweke, akagholosya akisa pakuyugha na pakumanyisya isya Yesu, napo akalumanya lwene ulosyo lwa Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Po akanda pakuyugha ngani nubukifu mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo, loli bo u Pulisila nu Akwila bamwifwa, bakamusenya nukubuka nawe ku nyumba yabo nukumulingannya akisa nisya sila ya Chala. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Bo u Apolo akulonda pakubuka ku Akaya, abitiki aba mu Efesi bakamukasya nukubasimbila abitiki aba mu Akaya ukuti bamupokele, bo afika, akabafwa ngani bo bakasubila ukwendela mu chisa cha Chala. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Pakuti akayughile kake kakaba namaka pakudalingana na ba Yuda pakati pa bandu, pakulangisya ukuti u Yesu we Kilisitu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli mukaya ka Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Bo u Apolo ali mu Kolindi, u Pabuli akapulusannya mukaya ka kumitu nukufika ku Efeso, ko akabagha abamanyili bamo, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />po akabalalusya akati, “Imba mukapokela u Mbepo Mwikemo bo umwe mwasubila?” Bakamula bakati, “Awe, tutifwile lumo ukuti kuli u Mbepo Mwikemo.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Po u Pabuli akabalalusya akati, “Imba losyo luki lo mukosiwa nalo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Bakamwamula bakati, “Ulosyo lwa Yohani.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:4">Mik1.4</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7">7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk3.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Yoh1.26</ref>.</char>
    </note>U Pabuli akati, “U Yohani akosyagha ulosyo lwa lupinduko, akababusya abandu ukuti basubile yo akwisa panyuma pake, yo we Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bo bifwa sisisi, bakosiwa mwilita lya Malafyale u Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Bo u Pabuli abika inyobe syake papabo, u Mbepo Mwikemo akisa papabo, po bakanda pakuyugha mundimi imbya, nukusolola. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bosi poka bakaba ngati abanalume twelovu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Po u Pabuli akingila mu nyumba yakwiputilamo, akayugha nubukifu imyesi mitatu, akayughisannya nu kubannyengelela nisya Bunyafyale bwa Chala. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Loli bamo bakaba nimyoyo imikafu, nukusita kusubila, bakayiyugha ububibi Isila ya Malafyale pamaso gha bandu, po u Pabuli akabaleka nukubasenya abamanyili nukubuka nabo, amasiku ghosi akabamanyisyagha munyumba ya Tilanasi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Akabomba bububu ifinja fibili, umwakuti bosi bo bakikalagha mu Asiya bakifwa isyu lya Malafyale, aba Yuda na ba Giliki.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abana ba Sikeva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />U Chala akabomba ifiswigho ifipalapala ni nyobe sya Pabuli, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />umwakuti ututambala na malaya agha kufuma mu mubili wake, ghakabikiwagha pa babine, po bakapolagha, sona nimbepo imbibi sikafumagha mumwabo. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Loli aba Yuda bamo abakwembela, bakafumyagha imbepo imbibi, bakaghela pakubombesya ilita lya Malafyale u Yesu kubo bakaba nimbepo imbibi, bakati, “Mwilita lya Yesu yo u Pabuli akulumbilila, ngukulamula ukuti ufumemo.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Abana abanalume seveni aba Sikeva, umu Yuda, usongo wa baputi bobo bakabomba sisisi.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Po imbepo imbibi yikabamula yikati, “U Yesu mumenye, sona nu Pabuli mumenye, loli imba umwe mwe ba wenu?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Po umundu yo akaba nimbepo imbibi akabanyelela nukubapota bosi. Akabachaya bosi umwakuti bakakinda munyumba yila bo batafwete nachimo, sona bo bafulalite. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Syosi sisisi sikamanyikwa ku ba Yuda na ba Giliki bo bakikalagha ku Efeso, po ubogha bukabagha bosi, ilita lya Malafyale u Yesu likaghindikiwa ngani. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Po abingi bo bakasubilagha bakisa, bakitika nukwilata imbibi syosi syo bakabombagha. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Po abingi bo bakabombagha ifyamayele bakabunganika poka amabuku ghabo nukocha pamaso gha bosi, po bakabelengela umutengo wake, bakasyagha indalama sya masalabasya fifite sabusani. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Po isyu lya Malafyale likasata sona likaba namaka.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifyongo mukaya ka Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Bo ifindu ifi fyabombiwa, u Pabuli akinong’onela mwa Mbepo pakubuka ku Yelusalemu, pakupulusannya mu Makedoniya na ku Akaya. Akati, “Bo nikalako kula kula, mbaghile pakubuka sona mu Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Po akatuma abafwilisi bake babili u Timoti nu Elasitasi ku Makedoniya, po umwene akikalako akabalilo akatali mu Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Pakabalilo kala kala kukaba ifyongo ifikulu ngani chifukwa cha Sila ya Malafyale. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Pakuti umundu yumo yo bakatingi Demetiliyo yo akasyana utufwani twa siliva utwa nyumba ya chala u Alitemi, po imbombo yake yikingisya indalama inyingi ngani ku babombi bake. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />U Demetiliyo akababungannya bosi poka, na babombi bo bakayana bubu nabo, akababusya akati, Mwe banalume, musimenye ukuti ubukabi bwitu bukufumila mumbombo yiyiyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Sona mukutesya nu kwifwa ukuti teko ku Efeso kwene, loli muchisu chosi icha Asiya, u Pabuli yuyu akabannyengelela nukubapindula abandu abingi, nukuyugha ukuti tebo ba chala aba bo bakupangiwa ni nyobe. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ubupala pala te bwakuti imbombo yitu yingayweluka yene awe, loli buliko sona na ku nyumba ya chala witu umukolo u Alitemi, bo bukwisa pakuba bwa bu, po weyo ayukwisiwa ubwa songo bwake, yo bosi aba Asiya ni chisu chosi ichapasi bakumwiputa.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bo bifwa sisisi, bakakalala ngani, nukwanda pakukuta ukuti, “Umukulu we Alitemi wa ku Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Po akaya kosi kakisula ni fyongo, bakamukola u Gayi nu Alisitalika, abandu aba ku Makedoniya bo bakendagha poka nu Pabuli, bakakindila kubuyo bwa nyangalo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Po u Pabuli akalondagha pakubuka mu chilundilo cha bandu, loli abamanyili batakamwitikisya. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Bamo aba songo aba mu Asiya, bo bakaba bamanyani bake, bakamutumila amasyu aghakumusoka ukuti atakingilemo mubuyo ubwa nyangalo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Po ulukomano lwabo losi lukaba nifyongo fyene, bamo bakakutagha ichindu choka, abanine ichingi pakuti abingi batakamanya ichifukwa cho bakabunganila. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Aba Yuda bakamusungila kundasi u Alikizandala, po bamo muchiludilo bakamubusya isyakuti nene, u Alikizandala, akabatebesya ichongo ni nyobe yake nukughesya pakuyugha amasyu ghakwipoka mwene. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Loli bo basyaghannya ukuti mu Yuda, po bakakuta ngani bosi isyu lyoka pa ma awala mabili ukuti, “Umukulu we Alitemi wa mu Efeso!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Po umusimbi wa kaya kala kala akatebesya ichilundilo nukubabusya ukuti, “Mwe bandu ba mukaya ka Efeso, we wenu yo atasimenye ukuti akaya ka Efeso ko kakusungilila inyumba ya chala u Alitemi, nichifwani cho chikawa ukufuma kumwanya. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Pololi nayumo yo akusikana sisisi, po mubaghile mube myee, sona mutakabombe ifindu umwakupulughana. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Pakuti mwisa na bandu aba kuno napo batibite nachimo mu nyumba ya chala pamo ukumusamula u chala witu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Pala u Demetiliyo nabafundi abanine bali ni nongwa nu mundu yumo, tuli nabalongi na amabuyo aghakulongelapo inongwa ghalipo, po bangabuka kula kula nukulonga inongwa syabo. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Loli pala muli nasyo isingi syo mukulonda, sibaghile siyughiwe palukomano lo lwitikisiwe ni ndaghilo. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Pakuti pali ubupala pala ubwakuti tungalongiwa nabo chifukwa cha syo sikubombiwa umusughu, patalipo ichifukwa ichenecho cho tungalingannya nifya chongo chichichi.”<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Bo ayugha sisisi, akababwesya abandu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Bo ifyongo fyamala, u Pabuli akabitisya abamanyili nukubalagha namasyu agha kubakasya, akanyamuka nukubuka ku Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Po akati akapulusannya mufingaba fila, akabakasya abandu na masyu amingi, akafika ku Gilisi. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Ko akikalako imyesi mitatu, bo ali papipi pakubuka ku Siliya mu bwato, akasyaghannya ukuti aba Yuda bakabatika pakumughogha, po akinong’ona pakunyokela ukwendela ku Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Po akaba poka nu Sopatelo umwana wa Pilo uwa mu Beleya, u Alisitaliko nu Sekundo uwa mu Tesalonika, u Gayi uwa mukaya ka Delibe, nu Timoti, u Tikika nu Tulofimo aba muchisu cha Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Abandu aba bakatangilako nu kutulindilila ku Tulowasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Loli tukanyamuka mubwato ukufuma ku Filipu, bo ghamala amasiku gha chibama ichisita chilungo, bo ghakilapo amasiku fayivi tukabakonga ku Tulowasi, ko tukikalako amasiku seveni.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubulendo ubwabumalilo ubwa Pabuli mu Tulowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Po isiku lya kwanda mwa sabata, bo twabungana poka nukumenyannya ichibama, u Pabuli akayugha na bandu, pakuti akalondagha pakufumapo ningelo, po akabukilila pakuyugha mupaka pa busiku. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Po mukaba inyale inyingi mu chipinda cha pamwanya pa chinine mo tukabunganamo. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Po umulumyana yumo yo ilita lyake akaba we Yutiko akikala pibwindo, po utulo utupapala tukamukola bo u Pabuli akwendelela pakuyugha, bo atamiwe nutulo, akawa pasi ukufuma muchipinda chabutatu pamwanya, bo bakumuseba bakagha afwile. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Loli u Pabuli akika pasi nukumuwila umulumyana yula nukumukukila, akati, “Mutakapasyaghe akali mumi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Po akakwela sona muchipinda chila, akamenyannya ichibama nu kulya, akayugha nabo akabalilo akatali mupaka kubuche, sona akufumapo. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Bakamusenya umulumyana yula nukubuka nawe kunyumba mumi, sona bakahoboka ngani.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufuma mu Tulowasi ukubuka mu Mileta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Po tukatangilapo pakubuka mubwato, tukakwela ukubuka mukaya ka Asosi, ko tukalondagha pakumusenya u Pabuli pakuti momo akatulaghilila, loli umwene akati akwenda pabwima. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Bo akomana nutwe ku Asosi, tukamusenya nukubuka nawe ku Mitileni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Tukakwela mubwato ukufuma kula kula sona ilya ningelo lyake tukafika piloboko lya Kiyo, ilya ningelo sona tukafika mu Samo, po ilya ningelo tukafika mu Mileta. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pakuti u Pabuli akinong’ona ukupululila mu Efeso, ukuti atakataghe akabalilo mu Asiya, pakuti akakindililagha ku Yelusalemu, pala chingabombiwa, pisiku ilya Pendekositi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akulaghana na basongo aba mu Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ukufuma ku Mileta u Pabuli akatuma amasyu ku Efeso pakubasuma abasongo ba chipanga ukuti bakomane nawe.<verse eid="ACT 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Bo bafika ku kwake, akababusya akati, ‘Mumenye mo ngikalilagha numwe akabalilo kosi ukwandila pisiku lyakwanda, lyo ngafikilagha mu Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />namubombela u Malafyale nukwiyisya kwangu kosi, sona namasosi, ningelo syo sikanyagha bo bakundegha aba Yuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Musimenye ukuti ndakafifapo nachimo cho chingaba cha kubafwa, syo ngakalumbilila ku kwinyu, nu kubamanyisya pabwelu inyumba ninyumba. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ngusimikisya ku ba Yuda na kuba Giliki isya kupindukila kwa Chala, nisya lwitiko mwa Malafyale witu u Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Po ulu, pakulongosiwa nu Mbepo, ngubuka ku Yelusalemu ukusita kumanya cho chaya pakumbonekela kula kula. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Loli chene cho njimenye chakuti u Mbepo Mwikemo akusimikisya mutwaya tosi, ukuti ijela ni ndamyo fikundindilila. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Tim4.7</ref>.</char></note>Loli ndakupasyapo nisya bumi bwangu ukuti bwapamwanya ku kwangu, po cho ngulonda chakuti imalisye imbombo yangu, nu bubombeli bo u Malafyale u Yesu akamba ubwakusimikisya Amasyu Amisa agha chisa cha Chala.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Po ipano simenye ukuti umwe mwe bosi nabendela nukulumbilila ubunyafyale bwa Chala, mutakwisa pakutesya sona icheni changu. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Pololi ngusimikisya ku kwinyu ipano, ukuti nde ninongwa nibanda lya mwebosi. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Pakuti ndakafifapo nachimo ku kwinyu, loli ngalumbilila syosi syo u Chala akulonda. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Po mwisungilile mwebene, nu lutimo losi lo u Mbepo Mwikemo akabika pakuba mwe balindilili, ukuti mube batimi ba Chipanga cha Chala, cho akaghula nibanda lya Mwana wake. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Simenye ukuti bo nafuma une, imbumbi ingali sikwisa mu mwinyu, sitakwisa pakululeka ulutimo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Akabalilo ka kwisa ko abandu bamo aba mu kabukatila kinyu bakwisa pakuyugha ubumyasi nukubannyengela abamanyili ukuti babakonge. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Pololi mube maso, mukumbukaghe ukuti pafinja fitatu umusanya nu busiku ndakalekapo nalumo pakubasoka mwebosi na masosi. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Po ipano ngubabika munyobe sya Chala na mumasyu gha chisa chake, gho chingabasenga nukubapa ichilingo mu bikemo bosi. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ndakanyenwapo u siliva pamo u golide pamo ifyakufwala fya mundu yumo. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Umwe mwebene musimenye ukuti nabombesyagha inyobe syangu ukuti fyaghe ifindu fyo une na bamanyani bangu tukasobelwagha. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mufindu fyosi fyo nabalangisya pakubomba ngani imbombo bububu, tubaghile pakubafwa abapotwe, mukumbukaghe amasyu gho u Malafyale u Yesu akayugha ukuti, ‘Ukupa kusayiwa ngani ukukila kupokela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Bo u Pabuli amalisya pakuyugha, akafughamila pasi nukwiputa nabo poka bosi. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bosi bakalilagha bo bakumukukila nukumufyofyona nukulaghana nawe, <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />bakaba ni chitima ngani chifukwa cha masyu gho akayugha ukuti te bakatesye sona icheni chake. Po bakamusindikila ku ngalaba.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akubuka ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Bo twalekana nabo tukanyamuka nu mungalaba, tukagholoka mupaka piloboko lya Kosi. Ningelo lyake tukafika mu Lodi, pakufuma kula kula tukafika ku Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ko tukayagha ingalaba yo yikabukagha ku Fonike, po tukakwela nu kubuka. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Bo twafika pabuyo bo tukatesyagha akasungo ka Sayipulasi, po tukenda kundende kwake ukwa kasungo kala nukufika ku Siliya, tukenda pisila pakubuka ku Tili, ko ingalaba yikabukagha pakwisya ukatundu. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Po tukabaghako abamanyili kula kula, tukikalako amasiku seveni, pakulongosiwa nu Mbepo bakamubusya u Pabuli ukuti atakabuke ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Loli bo amasiku ghitu ghamala, tukafumapo nukwendelela ubulendo bwitu, bosi poka abakasi na bana bakatusindikila mupaka ukufumamo mutwaya, po tukafughama pasi pambali panyanja nukwiputa. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Bo twalaghana nabo, tukukwela mu ngalaba, abene bakanyokela ku kwabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tukendelela nu bulendo bwitu ukufuma mu Tili nukufika mu Putolemasi, ko tukabalamuka abitiki nukwikala nabo isiku lyoka. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Imbo6.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8.5</ref>.</char></note> Ilya ningelo lyake, tukanyamuka nukufika ku Kesaliya, po tukingila mu nyumba ya Filipu umulumbili, weka uwa bandu seveni bala. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Akaba na balindu folo abasita kusenyiwa, bo bakasololagha.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:28">Imbo11.28</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo twikalapo amasiku amingi, umusololi yo akaba we Agabasi akafika ukufuma ku Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Po akisa kukwitu nukusenya ulamba wa Pabuli, akipinya mwene ifinama ni nyobe nukuti, “U Mbepo Mwikemo akuti, ‘Umwenecho wa lamba uyu akwisa pakupinyiwa bububu na ba Yuda ba mu Yelusalemu, po bakwisa pakumubika mu nyobe sya bandu Bapanja.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Bo utwe twifwa sisisi, utwe na bandu bamula mula tukamusuma u Pabuli ukuti atakanyamuke ukubuka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Po u Pabuli akamula akati, “Imba choni cho mukulila nukumba ichitima? Pakuti ndiyanisye pene pakupinyiwa loli napakufwa mu Yelusalemu chifukwa cha lita lya Malafyale u Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Bo twapotwa pakumunnyengela, tukamuleka nukuti, “Ubwighane bwa Malafyale bubombiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Bo amasiku ghamala, tukiyannya nukubuka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Tukabuka nabo bamo abamanyili ba ku Kesaliya, nukumusenya yumo u Munasoni uwa ku Sayipulasi, umumanyili wakwanda, yo tukabukagha ku nyumba yake pakwikala.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akumwendela u Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Bo twafika mu Yelusalemu abitiki bakatupokela nu lusekelo. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ilya ningelo lyake u Pabuli akabuka nutwe kwa Yakobo, po nabasongo bosi bakabako. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Bo abalamuka, akabapangila syosi syo u Chala akabomba ku bapanja ukwendela mu mububombeli bwake. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bo bifwa isi, bakamupala u Chala, po bakayugha kwa Pabuli bakati, “Tesya wamwitu, ukuti masabuzani malinga agha ba Yuda bo bakasubila, sona bosi biyipile pa kukonga indaghilo, <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />bakabusiwa ukuti wabamanyisyagha aba Yuda bosi bo bakaba mu bapanja ukusileka indaghilo sya Mozesi, ukubabusya ukuti batakasilimule abana babo pamo bakongaghe imiteto yabo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Po imba tubombe choni? Naloli bakwisa pa kwifwa ukuti wafika. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13-21">Ukk6.13-21</ref>.</char></note>Po bomba syo tukubusya, tuli na banalume folo bo bakafinga, <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />bababa ubasenye nukwiswepesya nabo poka, nukubalipilila ukuti babamwe iching’wili kumutu kwabo. Po bosi bakwisa pakumanya ukuti syosi syo wayugha syabumyasi, loli ukuti uwe ukwenda mundaghilo nu kusikonga. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Imbo15.29</ref>.</char></note>Loli abapanja bo bakasubila, tukabasimbila ukalata nu kutumula ukuti batakalye ichakulya cho chabikiwa kufifwani pakuba chakwiyipa, batakalye ibanda, batakalye ichinyamana cho cha nyongiwa bubu, sona batakalowe.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Po u Pabuli akabasenya abandu bala, ilya ningelo lyake akabomba nabo imiteto iyakwiswepesya, po akingila mu nyumba ya Chala, nukubabusya akamalile ka masiku aghakwiswepesya, sona ni fyakwiyipa fyo wesi abaghile pakubika.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akoliwa mu Nyumba ya Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Bo amasiku seveni ghali papipi pakumala, aba Yuda aba ku Asiya bakamutesya u Pabuli mu Nyumba ya Chala, bakasongelesya ichilundilo chosi, bakamukola, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />bakakuta bakati, “Mwe banya Izilayeli, mutwafwe, uyu mundu yo akamanyisyagha abandu kosi na kosi pakulusamula uluko lwitu, nindaghilo sya Mozesi, ni Nyumba ya Chala iyi, sona akabasenya aba Giliki nu kwingila nabo mu Nyumba ya Chala, nukunyasya ubuyo ubwikemo ubu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Imbo20.4</ref>.</char>
    </note>(Pakuti bakamutesya u Tulofimo uwa mu Efeso poka nu Pabuli mukaya mula mula, sona bakinong’ona ukuti akaba we Pabuli yo akamwitisya mu Nyumba ya Chala.) <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Po akaya kosi kakisula nifyongo, sona abandu bosi bakakindila poka, pakukola u Pabuli nukumughusila kusi ku Nyumba ya Chala, sona papapo napapapo imilyango yikighalika. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Bo bakughesya pa kumughogha u Pabuli, amasyu ghakatumiwa kwa songo wa basikali ukuti akaya ka mu Yelusalemu kosi kafulunganite. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Po pala pala usonga wa basilikali yula akabasenya abasongo bamo na basilikali nu kukindila ku chilundilo kula, bo bamutesya usongo wa basilikali na basilikali bala, bakaleka pakumukoma u Pabuli. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Po usongo wa basilikali akafika pala pala nukumukola u Pabuli, akalamula ukuti apinyiwe nimbingu sibili nukumulalusya ukuti, “Imba we wenu yuyuyu, sona akabomba cho choni? <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Bamo muchilundilo bakakuta ichindu choka, abangi ichinine, umwakuti usongo wa basilikali akapotwa pakuchagha ichenecho cho chikabombiwa chifukwa cha fyongo, po akalamula ukuti bamusenye nukumubika mwilinga. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Bo bafika pamakwelelo agha lupaso, abasilikali bakamunyamulila mumwanya pakuti ichilundilo chikakalala ngani. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Pakuti ichilundilo cha bandu chikamukongagha, bakakuta ngani bakati, “Mughoghe bubu!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akwiyimila mwene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Bo abasilikali bali papipi pa kumwingisya u Pabuli mwilinga, akamusuma usongo wabasikali akati, “Imba utanganyitikisya ukuti injughepo simo?” Po akati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Imba uchimenye ichi Giliki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Imba ute we wa mukaya ka Ijiputi, yo akandisya ifyongo nukubatangilila amafyeka folo thousand mungolongo?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />U Pabuli akamula akati, “Une ne mu Yuda, uwa mukaya ka Talisa muchisu cha Kilikiya, ne wa mukaya akafumukwe, po ngukusuma ukuti injughe nabo abandu bababa.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Bo amwitikisya, u Pabuli akimilila pamakwelelo gha lupaso nukulesya ichongo ni nyobe syake, bo baba myee, po akayugha nabo munjugha ya chiyuda akati,<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Mwe bakamu na batata, munyifwisye po ngwifighilila nemwene pandasi pinyu.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Bo bamwifwa ukuti akuyughila mu Chihebeli, bakabukila pa kuba myee, po u Pabuli akati, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Imbo5.34-39</ref>.</char></note> “Une ne mu Yuda, ngapapiwa mukaya ka Talisa muchisu cha Kilikiya, loli nakulila mukaya kakaka mufinama fya Gamaliyeli, ngamanyisiwa akisa mundaghilo sya batata bitu, sona ngiyula ngani pakubomba imbombo ya Chala ukuyana namo umwe mubelile mwe bosi ipano. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:3">Imbo6.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref>.</char></note>Ngabafwima nu kubaghogha abandu bo bakakonga ngani isila yiyiyi, ngabakola abanalume na bakolo nukubighalila mujela, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />ngati usongo wa baputi na kabukatila kosi aka balongi ba Chiyuda bangasimikisya ukuti nguyugha ubwanaloli, ngapokela abakalata abakufuma ku kwabo nukubuka nabo ku Damasika, ukuti inje mbasenye sona bo bakwikala kula kula nu kwisa nabo bapinyiwe nimbingu ku Yelusalemu ukuti bafundiwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akuyugha nisya kupinduka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Imbombo9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Bo ngwenda ngupalamila kukaya ka Damasika, bo isuba lili pamutu, umwakukenusya bubu ubwelu ubwakubala ngani ukufuma kumwanya, bukambalila une. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Po ngawa pasi nukwifwa isyu likuti, ‘We Sabuli, we Sabuli, imba choni cho ukufwima?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Po ngamula ngati, ‘Imba we wenu, Malafyale? Akambusya akati, ‘Ne Yesu uwa mu Nazaleti yo ukumufwima.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Po abene bo ngabanabo bakatesya ubwelu loli batakifwa isyu ku yo akayugha ku kwangu. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Po ngalalusya ngati, ‘Imba mbombe choni, Malafyale?’ Po u Malafyale akambusya akati, ‘Nyamuka, bukagha ku Damasika, ko ukwisa pakubusiwa syosi syo sibatikiwe kale ukuti ubombe.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ngapotwa pakutesya chifukwa cha kubala ngani kwa bwelu, po bo bakaba nune bakangola inyobe nu kufika ku Damasika.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Mukaya mula mula mukaba umundu yumo yo akaba we Ananiya, umundu uwa kumwiputa u Chala, yo akasikonga indaghilo, sona akayughiwa abwisa na ba Yuda bo bakikalagha kula kula. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Akisa nu kwimilila papipi nune nukumbusya ukuti, ‘Wamwitu Sabuli, tesya sona.’ Pakabalilo kala ngatesya sona, nukumutesya. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Po akati, ‘U Chala wa batata bitu akusalite uwe ukuti umanye ubwighane bwake, nukutesya umugholoke yula, sona nukwifwa isyu lyo likufuma mu mulomo wake. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Pakuti ukwisa pakuba we kamboni wake pakubabusya abandu bosi fyo wa tesya nu kwifwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Pololi imba ukulindilila choni? Nyamuka nukosiwa ukuti imbibi syako sisukiwe, po ukwitisya pilita lyake.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli itisiwa pakulumbilila ku bapanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Bo nanyokela ku Yelusalemu, ngiputagha mu nyumba ya Chala, ngatesya ichisetuka. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ngatesya u Malafyale akumbusya akuti, ‘Lubilo fumamo mu Yelusalemu muno chifukwa abandu kuno batakwisa pakwitikisya ubwakamboni bwako bo ukuyugha nisya une.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Po ngati, ‘Malafyale, basimenye ukuti ngabukagha ku nyumba ya kwiputilamo pakubighalila mujela nukubakoma bo bakasubilagha mumwako. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Imbo7.58</ref>.</char></note>Bo ukamboni wako u Sitefani akughoghiwa, une ngimilila pala pala ukusimikisya ukughoghiwa kwake, sona ngaba musungi wa malaya kubo bakamughogha.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Po u Malafyale akambusya akati, ‘Bukagha, pakuti ngwisa pakukutuma kubutalipo ku banja.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Abandu bakateghelesya kwa Pabuli mupaka po akayugha sisisi, po bakakwesya ngani amasyu ghabo bakati, “Umundu uyu musimisye pachisu chapasi! Pakuti atabaghile pakuba nu bumi.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Po bakakuta ngani nukutagha amalaya ghabo, nukutunnya ulufumbi ku mwanya, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />usongo wa basilikali yula akamula akati babuke nu Pabuli mwilinga, sona akababusya akati bamusyembe ukuti umwene amanye ichifukwa cho abandu bakakutila bububu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Loli bo bamupinya ukuti bamusyembe, u Pabuli akamulalusya usongo wa basilikali yo akimilila pala pala akati, “Imba indaghilo situ sikwitikisya pakumusyemba umwene kaya wa Chiloma, bo batamulongite inongwa yake?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Bo usongo wa basikali ifwa isi, akabuka kwa songo ngani uwa basilikali nukumubusya ukuti, “Imba ukubomba choni? Pakuti umundu uyu mwenekaya wa Chiloma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Po usongo yula akisa nu kumulalusya u Pabuli ukuti, “Mbusya, imba uwe we mwenekaya wa Chiloma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Po akamula akati, inga, nene.<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Po usongo wa basilikali akamula akati, “Ngaghula ubwenekaya nindalama inyingi ngani.” U Pabuli akamula akati, “Loli ubwenekaya bwangu bwakupapiwa nabo.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Po abene bo bakalondagha pakumulalusya bakamuleka papapo napapapo, nu songo wa basilikali sikamoghofya bo asyaghannya ukuti u Pabuli akaba mwenekaya wa Chiloma, sona nukuti bakamupinya ni mbingu.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli pamaso pa balongi ba Chiyuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Loli ilya ningelo, usongo wa basilikali akalondagha ukuti amanye ichifukwa cho aba Yuda bakamusitakila u Pabuli, po bakamusatula nukulamula ukuti abalongosi ba baputi na bakabukatila ka balongi bosi bakomane, po bakamusenya u Pabuli nu kumwimika pamaso pabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="s">U Pitala nu Kolineliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Kukabako umundu yumo mukaya ka Kesaliya, yo akaba we Kolineliya, u songo wa chilundilo cha basilikali cho bakati Itale. <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Umwene akaba mundu wakwiputa, sona wakumoghopa u Chala ni nyumba yake yosi, akabapagha abandu abingi ifyabupi, nu kwiputa akabalilo kosi kwa Chala. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Isiku limo akabalilo ka fili okoloko pachapamasuba u Kolineliya akatesya ichisetuka, uwandumi wa Chala akwisa kukwake nukuyugha ukuti, “Kolineliya!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Po akamulolelesya nu koghopa, nukumulalusya ukuti, “Wee Malafyale, Imba cho choni ichi?” Po uwandumi akamula akati, “Inyiputo syako nifyabupi fyako fikwelite kumwanya ngati fyakukumbukilamo u Chala. <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Po losulu ubatume abanalume mu Yopa, baye bamusenye umundu yumo yo we Simoni, yo bakuti we Pitala. <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Akwikala pa nyumba ya Simoni, umufukuta makwela, yo inyumba yake yili mumbali mwa nyanja.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Bo uwandumi yo akayugha nawe abuka, u Kolineliya akabitisya abambombo bake babili nu musilikali uwa kumwiputa u Chala, yo akamubombelagha akabalilo kosi. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Bo abalingannya syosi syo sikabombiwagha, akabatuma ku Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ilya ningelo lyake, bo bali pabulendo bwabo, bakupalamila mu Yopa, u Pitala akakwela pakasale pakwiputa, bo isuba lili pamutu. <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Isala yikamubaba u Pitala, po akalonda chimo ichakuti alye, loli bo bali pakutendekesya ichakulya, akatesya ichisetuka. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Po akatesya kumwanya kwighukite, sona ichindu chimo cho chikaboneka ngati cho chimwenda ichikulu, cho chikakoliwa mumbali syosi folo chikwika pasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Mula mula mukaba ifinyamana ifya finama folo, nafyo fikwendela ifukwe, nifiyuni fya mu mwanya. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Po isyu likamubusya ukuti, “Pitala, nyamuka, ghogha ulye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Loli u Pitala akati, “Malafyale, awe, ndalile lumo fyo fili mwiko sona nafyo finyalite.”<verse eid="ACT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Po isyu likifwika sona ilya bubili likati, “Cho u Chala achipaghula ukuti chisa, utakinong’one ukuti chinyalite.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Sisisi sikabombiwa katatu, papapo na papapo ichimwenda chila chikasenyiwa pakunyokela kumwanya.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Bo u Pitala akuswigha nisya ching’anamulo cha findu fyo akatesya muchisetuka chila, abandu bo bakatumiwa nu Kolineliya bakamanya ko inyumba ya Simoni yikaba. Po bakimilila pamulyango wa lupaso. <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Bakitisya nukulalusya pala alimo u Simoni, yo bakati Pitala.<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Bo u Pitala akali akwinong’ona ichighanamulo cha chisetuka chila, u Mbepo akayugha kukwake akati, “Ifwa! Abandu batatu bali kuno bakulonda.” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Po nyamuka bukagha nu kwika, po ubuke nabo kusita kukayikila pakuti nene nabatuma.” <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Po u Pitala akika nukubuka po abandu bala bakaba, akababusya akati, “Une nene mukundonda. Imba choni cho mwisa kuno?”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Bakamula bakati, “Usongo u Kolineliya, yo mundu mwisa uwa kumoghopa u Chala, sona aghindikiwe na ba Yuda bosi. Uwandumi umwikemo akamubusya ukuti akwitisye uwe ukuti ubuke ku nyumba yake, ukuti ifwe syo ukulonda pakuyugha.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Po u Pitala akabingisya mu nyumba abandu bala ukuba bagheni bake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:23">Isiku ilingi akanyamuka nukubuka nabo, sona nabanine bamo abitiki abakufuma mu Yopa, bakabuka nawe.<verse eid="ACT 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Pangelo pake bakafika mu Kesaliya, ko u Kolineliya akamulindililagha, akabitisya abakamu bake na bamanyani bake.<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Bo u Pitala akwingila mu nyumba, u Kolineliya akamupokela nu kuwa mufinama fyake, akamukwesya. <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Loli u Pitala akamunyamusya nukuti, “Imilila, nune ne mundu bubu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Bo u Pitala akuyugha nu Kolineliya, akingila mu nyumba mo abandu abingi bakabungana. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Po akababusya akati, “Umwe mwebene musimenye ukuti mwiko umu Yuda pakomana pamo pakubuka ku bapanja, loli u Chala andangisisye ukuti indeke ukuyugha yumo umundu ukuti mwiko pamo anyalite. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Bo nitisiwa nuwe, ngisa ukusita kukana, po ngulonda ndalusye choni cho wanyitisya?”<verse eid="ACT 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Po u Kolineliya akamula akati, “Amasiku matatu gho ghakilapo, pakabalilo ngati kaka, aka fili okoloko pachapamasuba, bo ngwiputa mu nyumba yangu, umwakukenusya bubu umundu akimilila pamaso pangu afwalite amalaya agha kunyikisila, <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />akati, ‘Kolineliya, inyiputo syako sifwika, sona nifyabupi fyako fyakumbukiliwa pamaso gha Chala. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Pololi tuma abandu ku Yopa ukuti bamwitisye u Simoni yo bakumwitisya ukuti u Pitala, umugheni mu nyumba ya Simoni umufukuta makwela, yo akwikala mumbali mwa nyanja.’ <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Papapo na papapo ngatuma abandu ku kwako, po chaba akisa pakuti wisa kuno. Pololi twebosi tuli pano pamaso gha Chala tukulindilila ukwifwa syosi syo u Malafyale akulaghile pakutubusya utwe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu gha Pitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Ukk10.17</ref>.</char>
    </note>Po u Pitala akanda pakuyugha akati, “Ipano nasyaghannya ukuti naloli u Chala atakusala umundu mo abelile, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />loli ifikolo fyosi, ku yo akumoghopa nu kubomba akisa, weyo mwene akumupokela. <verse eid="ACT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 23:36" />Mughamenye amasyu gho u Chala akabatumila abandu bamu Izilayeli, pakulumbilila Amasyu Amisa aghamutendele ukwendela mwa Yesu Kilisitu (yo we Malafyale wa bosi) <verse eid="ACT 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 23:37" />Mughamenye amasyu gho ghakafumusiwa mu Yudeya, ukwandila mu Galileya, bo u Yohani afuma bubu pakulumbilila isya losyo, <verse eid="ACT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 23:38" />namo u Chala akamupakasya u Yesu uwa mu Nazaleti nu Mbepo Mwikemo na maka, yo akabuka kosi nakosi, pakubomba inyisa nu kuposya bosi bo bakutamiwa nu satana, pakuti u Chala akaba nawe. <verse eid="ACT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 23:39" />Nutwe twe bakamboni ba fyosi fyo akabomba mu Izilayeli na mu Yelusalemu. Bakamughogha pakumupayika pambinjika. <verse eid="ACT 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 23:40" />Loli u Chala akamusyusya kubufwe bo ghakilapo amasiku matatu nu kumulangisya pabwelu, <verse eid="ACT 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 23:41" />teko ku bandu bosi, loli abakamboni bene bo u Chala akabasala nganila ngati utwe, twe tukalya nu kung’wa poka nawe bo asyuka ku bufwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 23:42" />Po akatulaghila ukuti tulumbilile ku bandu, nu kubasimikisya ukuti weyuyo u Chala amusalite kuba mulongi wa bo bali nubumi sona nabafwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 23:43" />Weyuyo bosi abasololi bakasimikisya ukuti wesi yo akusubila mumwake, akwisa pakupokela uluhobokelo lwa mbibi syake, ukwendela mwilita lyake.”<verse eid="ACT 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abapanja bakupokela u Mbepo Mwikemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 23:44" />Bo u Pitala akali akuyugha sisi, u Mbepo Mwikemo akawa pa bosi bo bakifwa amasyu ghake. <verse eid="ACT 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 23:45" />Po abitiki bo bakasilimuliwako, bo bakisa nu Pitala bakaswigha, ukuti ichabupi cha Mbepo Mwikemo chakusiwa pa bapanja. <verse eid="ACT 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 23:46" />Pakuti bakabifwa bakuyughila mundimi isingi nukumupala u Chala. Po u Pitala akamula akati, <verse eid="ACT 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 23:47" />“Imba alipo umundu yumo yo abaghile pakukanisya amisi ukuti abandu aba batakosiwe, bope bakapokela u Mbepo Mwikemo ngati twetwe?”<verse eid="ACT 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 23:48" />Po akabalamula ukuti bosiwe mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu. Po bakamusuma ukuti ikale nabo amasiku amapala bubu.<verse eid="ACT 23:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli pamaso pa Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Bo ghakilapo amasiku fayivi umuputi usongo u Ananiya akabuka na basongo bamo ku, poka nu mwimilili wa nongwa yo akaba we Telitula, po bakamupangila umulaghili wa chisu inongwa yo bakamulonga u Pabuli. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Bo bamwitisya u Pabuli, u Telitulasi akanda pakuyugha inongwa ukuti, “We mughindikiwa! Pasi pa bulongosi bwako tukaba numutende akabalilo akatali, sona ifingi ifisa fikabombiwagha muchisu chitu chifukwa cha bulongosi bwako ubwa mahala, <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />musila syosi nakosi, tukupokela nukupalisya mughindikiwa Felikisi. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Loli ndakulonda pakutaghila akabalilo kako, ngukusuma ukuti utupelele ichisa nu kuteghelesya syo tukulonda pakuyugha mubipimba. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Pakuti twamwagha umundu uyu ukuti we ndamyo, yo akwandisya ifyongo pakati pa ba Yuda muchisu chosi ichapasi, sona mulongosi wa kabukatila ka ba Nazalini. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Sona akaghesyagha pakuyinyasya Inyumba ya Chala, po tukamukola. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Pala ungamulalusya umundu uyu, uwe wemwene ubaghile pakusyaghannya syo anangite.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Po aba Yuda bope bakingililapo pakuyugha ukuti syosi sisisi sikaba syamomumo.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akwipoka mwene pamaso pa Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Bo umulaghili wa chisu amupalisya u pabuli ukuti ayughe, po u Pabuli akamula akati, “Simenye ukuti ukaba mulongi wa chisu ichi ifinja ifingi, po nahoboka ukuti niyimile nemwene pamaso papako. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ngati nuwe wemwene ungamanya akisa ngani, ghatakilitepo na masiku twelevu mo ngabukila mu Yelusalemu pakwiputa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Abanongwa yangu batakanyaghapo ngudalingana nu mundu yumo mu Nyumba ya Chala, pamo ngwandisya ifyongo mu nyumba syakwiputilamo, pamo mukaya akakulu ngani. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Po batangasimikisya ukuti syo bakunjughila ipano. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Loli cho mbaghile ukwitika ku uwe, chakuti ngwiputa u Chala wa banyenya bitu pakonga isila yake, yo bakuyugha ukuti ya bumyasi, ngusubila fyosi fyo fisimbiwe mu ndaghilo sya Mozesi, na mumabuku gha basololi, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />ngusubila mwa Chala ukuyana namo bope bakamwitika, ukuti kuyukuba ukusyuka kubufwe abandu abagholoke na babibi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Po akabalilo kosi ngughesya pakubomba inyisa ukuti imbe nu mabyebye umwisa pamaso pa Chala na pa bandu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Imbo21.17-28</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo fyakilapo ifinja ifingi, ngisa mu Yelusalemu pakubapa ifyabupe aba luko lwangu, sona nifyakwikemekesya. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Bo ngubomba sisisi, bakanyagha mu nyumba ya Chala bo niswepesisye, ukusita ichilundilo cha bandu pamo ichongo. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Loli pakaba aba Yuda bamo aba ku Asiya bo bali pano, bo babaghile bise pandasi pako nukuyugha pala bali ninongwa nune. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Pamo leka abandu bo bali pano bayughe bene inongwa yo bakanyagha nayo, bo nimilile pamaso gha balongi, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Imbo23.6</ref>.</char></note>ukupatula ichindu choka cho ngakuta bo nimilile pakati pabo, ‘Ukuyana nisya kusyuka kubufwe syosyo ngulongiwa numwe ipano.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Po u Felikisi, weyo akayimanya akisa Isila yiyiyi, akayimika inongwa nukuti, “Bo u Lisiyasi usongo wa basilikali isa, ngwisa pakutumula inongwa yako.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Po akamulamula usongo wa basilikali ukuti amusungilile u Pabuli, loli utubalilo tumo amupengeko ubusatuke nukubitikisya abamanyani bake ukuti bamupe ifyakusobelwa fyake.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli pamaso pa Felikisi nu Dulusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Bo ghakilapo amasiku ghamo u Felikisi akisa nu mukasi u Dulusila yo akaba mu Yuda, akamwitisya u Pabuli nukumuteghelesya, bo akuyugha nisya lwitiko mwa Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Bo u Pabuli akuyugha nisya bwisa, nisya kwikola, sona nisya kulongeliwa ko kukwisa, u Felikisi akaba nu bogha nukumubusya ukuti, “Bukagha lululu, ngwisa pakukwitisya pala nakagha akabalilo akisa.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Pakabalilo kala kala akinong’onagha ukuti u Pabuli akwisa pakumubeka ni ndalama, chocho chifukwa akamwitisyagha kabili kabili.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Bo fyakilapo ifinja fibili, u Polokiya Fesita akapyana pa Felikisi ngati we mulaghili wa chisu, u Felikisi akalondagha pakubahobosya aba Yuda, po akamuleka u Pabuli mujela.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli pamaso pa Fesita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Bo u Fesita afika mubuyo bwake, ghakilapo amasiku matatu po akabukagha ku Yelusalemu ukufuma ku Kesaliya. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ko abalongosi ba baputi na balongosi ba Chiyuda bakisa ku kwake ninongwa ya Pabuli, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />bakamusuma u Fesita ukuti abapelele ichisa pakumutuma u Pabuli ku Yelusalemu, pakuti bakabatika ukuti bamughoghe musila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />U Fesita akamula akati, “U Pabuli akusungiwa mujela ku Kesaliya, po une ngulonda pakubuka losulu. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Baleke abalongosi binyu bamo babuke poka nune ku Kesaliya nukuyugha inongwa ya mundu yuyu, pala anangite chimo.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Bo u Fesita ikala nabo amasiku eyiti pamo teni, akabuka ku Kesaliya, ilya ningelo lyake akikala pachitengo chakulongelapo inongwa nukulamula ukuti bise nu Pabuli pamaso pake. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Bo u Pabuli afika, aba Yuda bo bakafumagha ku Yelusalemu bakamusyungulila nukwanda pakumutamandila u Pabuli ifindu ifipala pala, fyo bakapotwa pakusimikisya. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Loli u Pabuli pakwipoka mwene akati, “Ndanangitepo nachimo ukuyana nindaghilo sya Chiyuda, pamo inyumba ya Chala, pamo kwa Kesali.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Loli u Fesita akalondagha pakubahobosya aba Yuda, po akamulalusya u Pabuli akati, “Imba ukulonda pakubuka ku Yelusalemu ukuti inongwa yako yilongiwe kula kula pamaso pangu?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Loli u Pabuli akati, “Ngwimilila pandasi pachitengo cha bulongi icha Kesali, ko mbaghile pakulongiwa, ku ba Yuda ndabanangilepo nachimo ukuyana namo uwe usimanyile akisa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Po pala nananga, pamo nabomba chimo cho mbaghile pakughoghiwa nacho, ndakukana pa kufwa, loli pala aba Yuda syo bakuyugha site syanaloli, atalipo na yumo yo angambika munyobe syabo, ngukusuma ukuti inongwa yangu yilongiwe nu Kesali.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Bo u Fesita ayughisannya na balongi abanine, akamula akati, “Wasuma ukuti inongwa yako yilongiwe nu Kesali, kwa kesali ko ukwisa pa kubuka.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli pamaso pa Agilipa nu Belenike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Bo ghakilapo amasiku, umalafyale u Agilipa nu Belenike bakafika kwa kesaliya pakumupokela u Fesita. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Bo bikalako amasiku amingi kula kula, u Fesita akamulingannya umalafyale nisya nongwa ya Pabuli akati, “Muno muli umundu yumo yo u Felikisi akamuleka mujela. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Bo nabuka mu Yelusalemu abalongosi ba baputi na basongo ba Chiyuda bakisa ninongwa yake, sona bakanda ukuti ndumule ukuti u Pabuli akananga. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Loli ngababusya ukuti indaghilo sya Chiloma sitakwitikisya pakumubika umundu munyobe sya banongwa yake, bo atakomanite nabo ukuti abe nulusako lwakwiyimila mwene. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Bo bisa kuno, ndakataghapo akabalilo, loli ilya ningelo lyake ngikala pachitengo cha kulongelapo inongwa nukulamula ukuti bise nu mundu yula. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Bo abanongwa yake bimilile, loli batakamupapo nayimo inongwa imbibi yo nginong’ona ukuti bangamupa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Loli ukudalingana kwabo kukaba kwakuyana ni chiputo chabo, sona nisya Yesu yo akafwa, loli u Pabuli akati mumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Bo napotwa pakubusikisya ubwanaloli bwa nongwa iyi, ngamulalusya u Pabuli pala akulonda pakubuka ku Yelusalemu ukuti inongwa yake yilongiwe kula kula. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Loli bo u Pabuli asuma ukuti bamusunge mujela mupaka po u Kesali atumula inongwa yake, po ngalamula ukuti bamusunge mujela mupaka po ngwisa pakumutuma kwa kesale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Po u Agilipa akamubusya u Fesita akati, “Nalondagha ukuti mwifwe umundu uyu nemwene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Akamwamula akati, “Ningelo ukwisa pakumwifwa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ilya ningelo lyake u Agilipa nu Belenike bakisa nu bughindikiwa ubukulu nukwingila mu nyumba yakukomanilamo, poka na basongo ba basilikali na balongosi aba kaya kala, po u Fesita akalamula ukuti bise nu Pabuli, po akisa nawe. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Po u Fesita akati, “Malafyale Agilipa, na bandu bosi bo bali nutwe muno, mukumutesya umundu uyu, yo aba Yuda bosi muno na mu Yelusalemu bakanda pakukuta ukuti atabaghile pakuba kubumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Loli une ndakamwaghapo ni nongwa nayimo yo abaghile pakufwa nayo, po pakuti umwenecho akalonda ukuti inongwa yake yilongiwe nu Kesali, po ngatumula ukuti abukaghe kula kula. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Loli une ndenasyo nasimo isyanaloli ukuti ningamusimbila umalafyale u Kesali nisya yuyo, po nisa nawe pamaso papako, napa malafyale u Agilipa ukuti pala wabusikisya inongwa yake, ningaba nasyo isyakusimba. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Pakuti chingaba chabupunganu ku kwangu ukutuma umukayidi ukusita kuyugha inongwa yo anangite.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akwipoka mwene pamaso pa Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Po u Agilipa akamubusya u Pabuli akati, “Witikisiwa pa kwiyughila wemwene.” Po u Pabuli akagholosya inyobe yake nukwipoka mwene ngati bo ulu:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“We Malafyale Agilipa, kwipima ukuti ne walusako ukuti umusughu nipoke ne mwene pamaso papako pafindu fyosi fyo aba Yuda bakunjughila nafyo, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />ngani ngani pakuti umenye akisa imiteto ya Chiyuda na matata ghabo ghosi. Po ngukusuma ukuti undeghelesye nu bololo.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Aba Yuda bosi babumenye ubumi bwangu ukwandila ku bwana bwangu, ukufuma pabwandilo bwa bumi bwangu mukaya ka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Imbo23.6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp3.5</ref>.</char></note>Bamenye ukwandila ko kubwandilo, pala bakulonda bangasimikisya, ukuti ukwandila ko kubwandilo nikile ngati mu Falisayi ukuyana nindaghilo sya chiputo chitu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Po ipano nimilile pano pakulongiwa chifukwa cha kusubila ipangano lyo u Chala akapangana na banyenya bitu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />ulu ifikolo fitu twelevu fikusubila ukufyagha, bo fikwiyula pakumubombela u Chala umusanya nu busiku, nu lusubilo lululu bakundonga aba Yuda, we Malafyale. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Choni cho mukuchagha chipala pala ngani pakusubila ukuti u Chala akususya abafwe?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Imbo8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22.4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Nune bubu nginong’ona ukuti mbaghile pakubomba chosi cho ningabomba pakususya ilita lya Yesu uwa mu Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Cho cho ngabomba mu Yelusalemu. Ngapokela ubulaghili ubwa baputi abasongo nukubighalila abandu abisa aba Malafyale mujela, sona bo bakughoghiwa, nune bubu ngitikisyagha. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Utubalilo utwingi ngabafundagha mu nyumba syakwiputilamo nukughesya pakubafyenga ukuti bamusamule u Yesu, ngabakalalila ngani umwakuti ngabukagha na mutwaya twakusi pakubafwima.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akulingannya nisya kupinduka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Imbombo9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ichi cho chifukwa cho ngabukila ku Damasika nu bulaghili, sona ni ndaghilo sya baputi abasongo. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Malafyale, bo isuba lyafika pamutu, bo indi musila, ngatesya ubwelu ukufuma kumwanya, bukwaka ngani ngati lisuba, bukambalila ukusyungulila une poka nabo ngaba nabo. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Po twe bosi tukawa pasi, ngifwa isyu likuyugha nune mu Chiyuda likuti, ‘We Sabuli, we Sabuli, choni cho ukufwima? Ukwifulasya wemwene ngati yo ngambaku yo yikubaya ichipimbili. <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Po ngalalusya ngati, ‘Imba we wenu, Malafyale?’ Po u Malafyale akamula akati, ‘Une ne Yesu yo ukumufwima. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Loli nyamuka nukwimilila, pakuti nakubonekela ukuti ngubike pakuba mubombi wangu nu kamboni wa syo watesya nisya une, sona nasyo ngwisa pakwilangisikisya mu mwako. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ngwisa pakupoka uwe ku bandu bako naba panja ko ngwisa pakukutumako, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />ukuti ubighule amaso ghabo umwakuti bafumeko ku chisi nukwisa ku bwelu, sona ukuti bafumeko kumaka gha satana ukuti bise kwa Chala, umwakuti imbibi syabo sihobokeliwe, sona nukupokela ubuyo pakati pa bandu bo basaliwa chifukwa cha lwitiko lwabo mu mwangu.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akulingannya imbombo yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Pololi, we Malafyale Agilipa, ndakaleka pakwifwila ichisetuka cha kumwanya. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Imbo9.20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>.</char></note>Loli nganda pakulumbilila mu Damasika, na mu Yelusalemu, sona namosi mu Yudeya, na ku bapanja bosi ukuti bapinduke nukunyokela kwa Chala, nukubomba ifindu fyo fingalangisya ukuti naloli bapindukite. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ichi cho chifukwa cho aba Yuda bakangola bo indi mu nyumba ya Chala nukughesya pakungogha. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Loli mupaka ni siku ili u Chala anyafwa, po nimilile pano pakusimikisya pa bapala na pa basongo, syo nguyugha siyanite bubu nasyo abasololi nu Mozesi akayugha ukuti fikwisa pakubombiwa; <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Kol15.20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Yis42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>.</char></note>ukuti u Kilisitu abaghile pakutamiwa, sona ukuti umwene abe wakwanda pakusyuka ku bufwe, ukuti alumbilile ubwelu ku bandu bake na ku bapanja.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bo u Pabuli akwipoka mwene, u Fesita akayugha nisyu lya pamwanya akati, “We Pabuli, upenite bati! Ukumanyila kwako kwa pamwanya kwakupennya. <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Loli u Pabuli akamula akati, “Awe, ndapenite, we mughindikiwa Fesita, loli syo nguyugha sya bwanaloli sona sya mahala. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Pakuti u Malafyale afimenye fyosi fififi, sona nguyugha nawe ukusita koghopa, pakuti simenye ukuti chitaliko nachimo cho utachimenye, pakuti ichi chitakabombiwagha kubusyefu. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Malafyale Agilipa, imba ukusubila abasololi? Simenye ukuti ukusubila.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Po u Agilipa akamulalusya u Pabuli akati, “Imba ukwinong’ona ukuti pakabalilo akapimba kakaka ungannyengelela pa kuba mu Kilisitu?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />U Pabuli akamula akati, “Napo kabalilo kapala pamo katali, ngwiputa kwa Chala ukuti umwe mwe bosi mwe mukundeghelesya ipano mube ngati nene, loli ukutisyako syene imbingu.<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Po umalafyale, umulaghili wa chisu, u Belenike na bandu bosi bakimilila, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />bo bafumamo munyumba bakayughisannya bene bene bakati, “Umundu uyu atanangitepo nachimo cho abaghile pakufwa nacho pamo pakubikiwa mujela.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Po u Agilipa akamubusya u Fesita akati, “Umundu uyu ngali asatuliwa pala atakalondagha ukuti inongwa yake yilongiwe nu Kesali.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akwenda pa nyanja ukubuka ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Bo kwatumuliwa ukuti tubuke kuchisu cha Itale ukwenda pa mungalaba, u Pabuli na bakayidi abanine bakabikiwa munyobe sya songo wa basilikali uwa kabukutila ka Kesali, ilita lyake Juliyasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Po tukakwela mu ngalaba ukufuma ku Adilametiyamu bo bukaba papipi pakunyamuka ukubuka mumaloboko gha muchingaba cha Asiya, po tukanyamuka, u Alisitalika uwa mukaya ka Tesalonika muchingaba cha Makedoniya akaba poka nutwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ilya ningelo lyake tukafika mu Sidoni, u Juliyasi akamupelela ichisa u Pabuli, po akamwitikisya ukuti abuke pakutesya abamanyani bake ukuti bamupe ifyakusobelwa fyake.<verse eid="ACT 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Tukanyamuka ukufuma kula kula tukakwela ubwato, tukenda kumbali kwa kasungo ka Sayipulasi pakuti imbepo yikatupingagha. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Bo twaloboka inyanja, tukabuka pa bwato ku Silikiya na ku Pamufiliya nukufika mukaya ka Mila muchingaba cha Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ko usongo wa basilikali akayagha Ingalaba yo yikafumagha ku Alekizandiliya pakubuka ku Itale, po akatukwesya mula mula. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tukenda papala papala amasiku amingi ni ndamyo ingulu ngani mupaka tukafika mukaya ka Kinida, bo imbepo yakanisya ubulendo bwitu, tukabuka kundende kwa kasungo ka Kileti, ko kakaba papipi nu Salimoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tukendagha mumbali mwa kasungo kala umwakutamiwa ngani nukufika kubuyo bo bakati Maloboko Amisa, gho ghakaba papipi nakaya ka Laseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Tukatagha akabalilo akatalingani kula kula mupaka kukanda pakoghofya ukwendelela nu bulendo chifukwa akabalilo kakutusya pakulya kakaba kakuti kamalite kale, po u Pabuli akabasoka akati, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Mwe banalume, ngutesya ukuti ubulendo bwitu bukwisa pakuba bwakoghofya. Ukatundu ni ngalaba fikwisa pakunangika ngani sona nu bumi bwitu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Loli usongo wa basilikali akifwila syo uwakwendesya ingalaba numwenecho bakayugha, ukukila syo u Pabuli akayugha. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Piloboko pala pala patakaba pisa ukwikalapo akabalilo ka lupepo, po abingi batakalondagha ukuti tufumepo pabuyo bula pa bwato nukughesya pa kufika ku Fonike, pala chingabombiwa ukuti bangikala kula kula akabalilo ka lupepo. Fonike lyo liloboko lya mu Kileti, pakulumbila kundende kubwingililo bwa lisuba, na kumitu kubufumilo bwa lisuba.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbepo yakukuka pa nyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Bo imbepo yo yikafumagha kundende yikanda pakuputa papala papala, abandu bakinong’ona ukuti bachagha cho bakalondagha, bakatisya ichela iching’wamu cho chikakola ingalaba, po bakanda pakwenda mumbali mwiloboko lya Kileti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Loli bo penda papala, imbepo yakukuka yo bakatingi imbepo ya kumitu kubufumilo bwa lisuba, yikakuka ukufuma ku kasungo. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Imbepo yila yikakoma ingalaba umwakuti bukapotwa pakwendelela pakubuka ko imbepo yikafumilagha, po tukabuleka ukuti tusungiliwe bubu ni mbepo. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Tukafika papipi na kasungo akapala ko bakati Kabunda, kumbali ko kutakabako imbepo, umwakutamiwa tukabupoka ubwato, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />tukabukwesya ubwato bula mu ngalaba, po tukapinyilila ingalaba ni ndisi ukuti yibe na maka, bakoghopagha ukuti bangabandiliwa pamusesenga wa piloboko lya Libiya, po bakisya umwenda nukuyileka ingalaba ukuti basungiliwe bubu ni mbepo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Imbepo iyakukuka yila yikendelela, po ilya ningelo lyake bakanda pakutagha ukatundu mu misi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Po pisiku lyabutatu bakatagha ifingaba fimo ifya ingalaba mumisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Tutakatesya isuba pamo indondwa amasiku amingi, sona imbepo yene yikendelela pakukuka ngani, pabumalilo tukatagha ulusubilo ulwakuti tungapona.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Bo bikalapo akabalilo akatali ukusita kulya nachimo, u Pabuli akimilila pakati pabo akati, “Banalume mwee, mundeghelesye une cho ngayugha une, nukusita kufumamo mu Kileti, ngali ifindu fitakomanika bububu. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Loli ulu ngubasuma ukuti mukibe ngani umoyo, nayumo umundu mumwinyu yo akwisa pakufwa, loli ingalaba yene yo yikwisa pakukomanika. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Pakuti ubusiku bo bwamalagha uwandumi wa Chala yo ne wake, sona yo ngumubombela akimilila kumbali ku kwangu, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />nukuyugha ukuti, ‘Utakoghope Pabuli, ubaghile pakwimilila pamaso pa Kesali, po tesya, u Chala akakupa bosi bo ukwenda nabo poka. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Po mukibe ngani umoyo, banalume, pakuti indi nulwitiko mwa Chala ukuti akwisa pakusibomba ukuyana namo akambusikisya une. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Loli tukwisa pakubandilawa pa kasungo kamo.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Pabusiku ubwa pa fotini, bo tukali tukusungiliwa ni mbepo panyanja ya Adiliya, ababombi aba mungalaba bakinong’ona ukuti tuli papipi ukufika pabwima. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Po bakapima ubutali bwa misi panyanja pakundwibika ibwe lyo bakalipinya nu lulisi nu kwagha ukuti bukaba amatamba fote, bo benda papala bakapima sona nukwagha ukuti buli namatamba sate. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Po pakoghopa ukuti ubwato bungabandiliwa namabwe, bakandwibika ifyela ifing’wamu folo kunyuma kwa bwato ukuti fibukole, sona bakiputa ukuti kuche lubilo. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ababombi aba ngalaba yila bakaghesya pakukindamo, bakisya ubwato pamisi ngati po babuka pakudwibika ifyela ifingi ifingw’amu kundasi kwa bwato bula. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Po u Pabuli akamubusya usongo wa basilikali sona na basilikali akati, “Pala ababombi aba batakwikalamo mungalaba umu, mutangapona. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Po abasilikali bakaputula indisi sya bwato, nukubuleka ukuti bubukaghe.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Pangelo pake bo nisuba likali pa kufuma, u Pabuli akabasuma bosi ukuti balye ichakulya, akati, “Ipano lisiku lya fotini lyo mwalindililagha nukusita kulya, sona akabalilo kosi mutalya nachimo. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Pololi ngubasuma ukuti mulye ichakulya, chikwisa pakubapa maka, pakuti nayumo mu mwinyu yo iching’wili cha kumutu wake chikwisa pakusobela.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Bo u Pabuli ayugha sisisi, akasenya ifibama nukupalisya kwa Chala pamaso gha bosi, po akafimenyannya nukwanda pakulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Po bakakiba umoyo bosi, sona bosi bakalya ichakulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Po twebosi poka mungalaba tukaba tuhandelendi sevenity sikisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Bo bosi bikuta, bakayipepusya ingalaba pakutagha ingano yosi mu nyanja.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukupangungana kwa ngalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Bo kwacha ababombi ba bwato bakapotwa pakumanya ichisu, loli bakatesya ubuyo bwa musesenga, po bakinong’ona ukuti pala singitikisiwa yingabandiliwapo ingalaba. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Po bakaputula ifyela ifing’wamu fila nukufileka ukuti fidwibe mu nyanja, sona mukabalilo koka kala kala bakasatula indisi syo sikapinyiliwa kufyakufighila ingalaba, po bakakwesya umwenda kundasi kwa ngalaba ukuti imbepo yisungile nu kubuka pisila. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Loli ingalaba yila yikabandiliwa pamusesenga, kundasi kwa ngalaba yila kukakatila, bo kunyuma kukulepungana chifukwa cha mayigha.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Po abasilikali bakinong’ona ukuti baghoghe abakayidi bosi, ukuti atakabepo nayumo uwakusaba nukukinda. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Loli usongo wa basilikali yula akalondagha pakumupoka u Pabuli, po akabakanisya pakubomba ubwighane bwabo, akabalamula bo bangasaba ukuti banyelele mu misi nukusaba pakubuka pabwima. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Po abangi bakababusya ukuti bakwele pamatabwa pamo patupato twa ngalaba, sonamomo twebosi tukaponela nukufika pabwima.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli pa kasungo ka Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Bo twafika akisa pisila, tukamanya ukuti ilita lya kasungo likaba we Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Abandu aba pa kasungo kala bakaba bachisa ngani kukwitu nukutupokela akisa, bakatupembela umulilo ukuti tote pakuti ifula yikawanga sona kukatalala ngani. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />U Pabuli akabunganika umusigho wangwi nukusungisya pamulilo, po injoka yikafuma mumusigho mula chifukwa chakutukila, yikamuluma nukumukakatila inyobe. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Bo abenekaya ba tesya injoka yikumukwela kunyobe yake, bakayughisannya bene bene bakati, “Naloli umundu uyu mufyeka, napo akapona panyanja, ubwanaloli butakumwitikisya ukuti abe nu bumi.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Loli u Pabuli akayikung’undila injoka yila pamulilo ukisita kufulala. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Abandu bala bakalindililagha nu kwinong’ona ukuti akwisa pakwisula pamo akwisa pakuwa pasi nukufwa lubilo, loli bo balindilila akabalilo akatali, ukusita kumubonekela chimo ichigheni bakanyosyako inyinong’ono syabo nukuti, “Umundu uyu we chala!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Papipi nu buyo bula bula pakaba imighunda ya Pululiya, umulaghili wa pa kasungo pala, akatupokela akisa nu kwikala nutwe amasiku matatu pakuba bagheni bake. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Po uwise wa Pubuliya akalambalala pachitala chifukwa akabinagha isekema, sona akapelagha ibanda, u Pabuli akingila mula mula nukumwiputila, po akabika inyobe papake nukumuposya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Bo isi syabombiwa, abandu bosi bo bakabina pa kasungo pala bakisa sona bakapola. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Bakatupa ifyabupi ifingi, sona bo twiyanisye pakunyamuka, bakakwesya ifindu fyosi fyo tukasobelwagha pa bulendo bwitu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufuma mu Melita ukubuka ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Bo yakilapo imyesi mitatu tukenda mu ngalaba ukufuma mu Alekizandiliya, bo bakatingi, ‘Abana abamapasa, bo bakikala pa kasungo pala pachisiku. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tukafika mukaya aka Silakusi nukwikalako amasiku matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ukufuma kula tukenda nukufika mukaya ka Legiyamu, ilya ningelo lyake imbepo ya kundende yikanda pakukuka, po pisiku ilingi tukafika mukaya ka Puteyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ko tukabagha abawamwitu bo bakatusuma ukuti twikale nabo usabata. Po tukafika ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Bo abawamwitu bifwa ukuti tukwisa, bakisa mupaka pa Munalo wa Apiya, sona ni Nyumba Sitatu sya bagheni ukuti bakomane nutwe, bo u Pabuli abatesya bubu, akamupalisya u Chala sona ichi chikamukasya ngani.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli mukaya ka Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Bo twafika mu Loma, u Pabuli akitikisiwa ukuti ikalaghe mwene nu musilikali uwakumulindilila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Bo ghakilapo amasiku matatu u Pabuli akabitisya abalongosi ba Chiyuda, bo babungana, akababusya akati, “Mwe bakamu, napo ndabanangilepo nachimo abandu pamo imiteto ya batata bitu, loli ngakoliwa mukaya ka Yelusalemu nukubikiwa mu nyobe sya ba Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Bo babusikisya inongwa yangu, abene bakalondagha pakusatula pakuti batakanyagha ni nongwa yakuti ngoghiwe nayo. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Imbo25.11</ref>.</char></note>Loli bo aba Yuda bakana, ngafyengiwa bubu pakusuma ukuti inongwa yangu yilongiwe nu Kesali, napo ndakaba ni nongwa nayimo na baluko lwangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ichi chocho chifukwa ngasuma ukuti ngomane nawe ukuti tuyughisannye, pakuti mbinyiwe ni mbingu chifukwa cha kusubila syo abanya Izilayeli bakalindililagha.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bakamula bakati, “Tutapokelitepo abakalata abakufuma ku Yudeya aba kuyugha nisya uwe, sona nayumo umundu mubakamu binyu yo isilepo kuno pakutulingannya pamo pakuyughapo nisya bubibi bwako. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Loli tukulonda twiyifwile twebene inyinong’ono syako, pakuti tusimenye ukuti kosi nakosi abandu bakuyugha ifibibi akabukutila kako.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Po bakifwana nawe isiku lyakuti bakomane, po ichilundilo cha bandu chikisa ku nyumba yo u Pabuli akikalagha, akabalingannya nu kuyugha nabo isya Bunyafyale bwa Chala ukwanda pangelo mupaka pabusiku, nukughesya pakubannyengelela nu kuyugha nabo nisya Yesu ukufuma mu ndaghilo sya Mozesi na mubasololi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Po bamo sikabakola syo u Pabuli akayugha, loli bamo batakasubilagha. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Loli bo batakwifwana, bakasata bubu bo u Pabuli ayugha isyu lyoka ukuti, “U Mbepo Mwikemo akayugha ubwanaloli na batata binyu bo akayugha ukwendela mu musololi u Yisaya ukuti,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Yis6.9-10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bukagha nukubabusya abandu aba ukuti, Ukwifwa muyukwifwa, loli temukifwisye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">ukutesya muyukutesya, loli temukatesye.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Pakuti imyoyo ya bandu aba mikafu ngani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">sona amakutu ghabo ghali namapuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">na maso ghabo ghasisilite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ukuti bangatesya namaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">batangifwa namakutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bangasyaghannya nimyoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">po pindukila kukwangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ukuti une mbaposye.’<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Po musyaghannye ukuti lelo ubupoki bwa Chala ubu, butumiwe kubapanja, bene bo baya pakwifwisya.”<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Po u Pabuli akikala kula kula ifinja fibili mu nyumba yo akalipilagha mwene, akabapokela bosi bo bakisa pakumutesya. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Akalumbililagha nisya Bunyafyale bwa Chala nu kumanyisya nisya Malafyale u Yesu Kilisitu nubukifu bosi, sona ukusita kumupinga yumo.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>